MU_I18N({"'You can't win anything with kids.' Ince, Hughes and Kanchelskis were sold in the summer; Beckham, Scholes, Butt, Gary Neville and Phil Neville came in, and United lost the opening day at Villa Park. Newcastle were 12 points clear in January; Cantona, back from his eight-month ban, scored the only goal in six of United's wins in the spring, including at St James' Park. The title was sealed 3–0 at Middlesbrough on the last day, and Cantona's late volley beat Liverpool in the final for a second Double.":"'You can't win anything with kids.' Ince, Hughes og Kanchelskis blev solgt om sommeren; Beckham, Scholes, Butt, Gary Neville og Phil Neville kom ind, og United tabte premieren på Villa Park. Newcastle var 12 point foran i januar; Cantona, tilbage fra sin otte måneder lange karantæne, scorede det eneste mål i seks af Uniteds sejre i foråret, også på St James' Park. Mesterskabet blev sikret med 3–0 i Middlesbrough i sidste spillerunde, og Cantonas sene volley slog Liverpool i finalen og gav endnu en Double.","1986–2013. 1496 matches, 893 won, 337 drawn, 266 lost (60% wins). 13 Premier League titles, 5 FA Cups, 4 League Cups, 10 Community Shields (inc. 1 shared), 2 UEFA Champions Leagues, 1 European Cup Winners' Cup, 1 European Super Cup, 1 Intercontinental Cup, 1 FIFA Club World Cup.":"1986–2013. 1496 kampe, 893 vundet, 337 uafgjort, 266 tabt (60% sejre). 13 Premier League-titler, 5 FA Cup-titler, 4 Liga Cup-titler, 10 Community Shields (heraf 1 delt), 2 UEFA Champions League-titler, 1 Pokalvindernes Europa Cup, 1 UEFA Super Cup, 1 Intercontinental Cup, 1 VM for klubhold.","1–0 aet against Everton at Wembley Stadium. Manager: Ron Atkinson. Scorers: Whiteside. Moran was initially refused a medal; the FA relented. Moran became the first man sent off in an FA Cup final; ten men held the champions, and Whiteside curled the winner past Southall in extra time.":"1–0 e.f.s. mod Everton på Wembley Stadium. Manager: Ron Atkinson. Målscorere: Whiteside. Moran fik først nægtet en medalje; FA gav sig. Moran blev den første spiller, der blev udvist i en FA Cup-finale; ti mand holdt mestrene, og Whiteside curlede sejrsmålet forbi Southall i den forlængede spilletid.","1–0 against Liverpool at Wembley (original). Manager: Alex Ferguson. Scorers: Cantona. James punched a corner out; Cantona, adjusting his body on the edge of the box, volleyed through the crowd. Liverpool's white suits are the other memory.":"1–0 mod Liverpool på Wembley (det gamle). Manager: Alex Ferguson. Målscorere: Cantona. James boksede et hjørnespark ud; Cantona justerede kroppen på kanten af feltet og sendte en volley gennem mængden af spillere. Liverpools hvide jakkesæt er det andet, man husker.","1–0 against Nottingham Forest at Wembley Stadium. Manager: Alex Ferguson. Scorers: McClair. Giggs set it up. Forest had beaten United in the 1990 FA Cup quarter and the 1991 League Cup; this was the first final between the clubs.":"1–0 mod Nottingham Forest på Wembley Stadium. Manager: Alex Ferguson. Målscorere: McClair. Giggs lagde op. Forest havde slået United i FA Cup-kvartfinalen i 1990 og Liga Cup'en i 1991; det var den første finale mellem klubberne.","1–1, 6–5 on penalties against Chelsea. Manager: Alex Ferguson. Scorers: Ronaldo. Drogba sent off in extra time for a slap on Vidić. Giggs, on for Scholes, broke Charlton's appearance record and scored the decisive penalty. Ronaldo's header, Lampard's equaliser, Drogba sent off in extra time; Ronaldo missed his penalty, Terry slipped, van der Sar saved from Anelka. Won 6–5 on penalties.":"1–1, 6–5 efter straffespark mod Chelsea. Manager: Alex Ferguson. Målscorere: Ronaldo. Drogba udvist i den forlængede spilletid for en lussing til Vidić. Giggs, der kom ind for Scholes, slog Charltons rekord for flest kampe og scorede på det afgørende straffespark. Ronaldos hovedstød, Lampards udligning, Drogba udvist i den forlængede spilletid; Ronaldo brændte sit straffespark, Terry gled, van der Sar reddede fra Anelka. Vandt 6–5 efter straffesparkskonkurrence.","2–1 against Bayern Munich. Manager: Alex Ferguson. Scorers: Sheringham, Solskjær. Keane and Scholes suspended. Bayern hit the woodwork twice through Scholl and Jancker before the two corners. 'Football, bloody hell.' Basler's free-kick after six minutes, nothing for 84 more, then Sheringham from Giggs' scuff in the 91st and Solskjær's toe-poke from Sheringham's flick in the 93rd. The Treble.":"2–1 mod Bayern München. Manager: Alex Ferguson. Målscorere: Sheringham, Solskjær. Keane og Scholes i karantæne. Bayern ramte træværket to gange ved Scholl og Jancker før de to hjørnespark. 'Football, bloody hell.' Baslers frispark efter seks minutter, intet i 84 minutter mere, så Sheringham på Giggs' mishit i det 91. og Solskjærs tåspark på Sheringhams flick i det 93. The Treble.","4–0 in the replay after 2–2 against Brighton & Hove Albion at Wembley Stadium. Manager: Ron Atkinson. Scorers: Robson 2, Whiteside, Mühren. Robson declined the penalty that would have given him a hat-trick and handed it to Muhren.":"4–0 i omkampen efter 2–2 mod Brighton & Hove Albion på Wembley Stadium. Manager: Ron Atkinson. Målscorere: Robson 2, Whiteside, Mühren. Robson afslog det straffespark, der ville have givet ham et hattrick, og gav det til Muhren.","4–1 aet against Benfica at Wembley Stadium. Manager: Matt Busby. Scorers: Charlton 2, Best, Kidd. Stepney's save from Eusébio in the last minute of normal time kept it level. Kidd scored on his 19th birthday. First English winners.":"4–1 e.f.s. mod Benfica på Wembley Stadium. Manager: Matt Busby. Målscorere: Charlton 2, Best, Kidd. Stepneys redning fra Eusébio i sidste minut af den ordinære spilletid holdt det lige. Kidd scorede på sin 19-års fødselsdag. De første engelske vindere.","A bag or backpack is allowed if it is small enough to fit under your seat, subject to a full search at the turnstiles; larger luggage can be left free of charge at the Information Centre by Entrance 9, open three hours before kick-off until 30 minutes after the final whistle. Banned items include knives, fireworks, smoke canisters, air horns, flares, weapons, laser devices, bottles, glass, cans, poles and drones; only soft drinks under one litre in factory-sealed plastic bottles may be brought in, no alcohol.":"En taske eller rygsæk er tilladt, hvis den er lille nok til at være under sædet, efter en fuld visitation ved tælleapparaterne; større bagage kan afleveres gratis i Information Centre ved Indgang 9, åbent fra tre timer før kampstart til 30 minutter efter slutfløjtet. Forbudte genstande omfatter knive, fyrværkeri, røgbomber, trykluftshorn, nødblus, våben, laserudstyr, flasker, glas, dåser, stænger og droner; kun læskedrikke under en liter i fabriksforseglede plastflasker må medbringes, ingen alkohol.","A curated shelf rather than everything ever published: what each one adds, and where to find it. Tick what you've done — that's kept in this browser. Streaming availability moves between regions, so the \"where\" is the publisher or the platform that first carried it.":"En udvalgt hylde frem for alt, der nogensinde er udgivet: hvad hver enkelt tilføjer, og hvor du finder den. Sæt flueben ved det, du har læst eller set — det gemmes i denne browser. Streamingtilgængelighed skifter mellem regioner, så \"hvor\" er udgiveren eller den platform, der først havde den.","A fourth title in five years, won with the lowest points total of Ferguson's championships and a European Cup semi-final lost to Borussia Dortmund. Solskjær, an unknown £1.5m signing from Molde, finished top scorer; Beckham scored from halfway at Selhurst Park on the opening day and was PFA Young Player of the Year. The title was confirmed on 6 May when Liverpool and Newcastle both failed to win; Cantona retired twelve days later, at 30.":"Det fjerde mesterskab på fem år, vundet med det laveste pointtal i Fergusons mesterskaber og en tabt semifinale i Mesterholdenes Europa Cup mod Borussia Dortmund. Solskjær, et ukendt køb til £1.5m fra Molde, blev topscorer; Beckham scorede fra midterlinjen på Selhurst Park i premieren og blev kåret som PFA Young Player of the Year. Mesterskabet blev sikret 6. maj, da hverken Liverpool eller Newcastle vandt; Cantona stoppede karrieren tolv dage senere, 30 år gammel.","After evening games the trains back to London are limited, usually 22:23 and 22:43, and there are no post-match options at all on the Peterborough line after evening matches. The Portman Road car park exit is closed for 15-20 minutes after the game while pedestrians clear and nearby roads take at least an hour to clear. Last trains to Manchester: not stated.":"Efter aftenkampe er togene tilbage til London begrænsede, normalt 22:23 og 22:43, og der er slet ingen muligheder efter kampen på Peterborough-linjen efter aftenkampe. Udkørslen fra Portman Road-parkeringspladsen er lukket i 15-20 minutter efter kampen, mens fodgængerne kommer væk, og vejene i nærheden tager mindst en time om at blive ryddet. Sidste tog til Manchester: ikke oplyst.","After the game, segregation means away fans cannot turn left towards Arena Shopping Park; you are directed across Car Park B (where away coaches park) and left at the exit gate to reach the shopping park and the train station. The A444 Jimmy Hill Way is closed for a short period after every match. Shuttle buses back to the city centre leave Arena Park from two hours after kick-off at half-hour intervals (for a 3pm game 17:00 to 18:30); expect station queues and gridlocked roads. Last trains to Manchester or London: not stated.":"Efter kampen betyder adskillelsen, at udebanefans ikke kan dreje til venstre mod Arena Shopping Park; du bliver ledt over Car Park B (hvor udebanebusserne holder) og til venstre ved udkørslen for at nå indkøbscentret og togstationen. A444 Jimmy Hill Way er lukket kortvarigt efter hver kamp. Shuttlebusser tilbage til centrum kører fra Arena Park fra to timer efter kampstart med en halv times mellemrum (for en kamp kl. 15 fra 17:00 til 18:30); regn med køer på stationen og totalt stillestående trafik. Sidste tog til Manchester eller London: ikke oplyst.","After the match, Metro passengers heading north towards Newcastle must board at Stadium of Light station, while those heading south must board at St Peter's. Expect heavy traffic and a residents-only parking scheme nearby; the Park and Ride buses continue running after the game. Last trains to Manchester or London: not stated.":"Efter kampen skal Metro-passagerer mod nord mod Newcastle stige på ved Stadium of Light-stationen, mens dem mod syd skal stige på ved St Peter's. Regn med tung trafik og en parkeringsordning kun for beboere i nærheden; Park and Ride-busserne kører videre efter kampen. Sidste tog til Manchester eller London: ikke oplyst.","All South Stand kiosks and the club shop are cashless. Have your barcode ticket ready for the scanners and allow time for searches; arriving 15 minutes before kick-off means queuing. No re-admission; a half-time smoking area is outside the South Stand; drums are not allowed in the away end and flags need prior approval via safety@ccfc.co.uk. Car Park C is the closest paid parking to the South Stand.":"Alle kiosker i South Stand og klubbutikken er kontantfri. Hav din billet med stregkode klar til scannerne, og beregn tid til visitation; ankommer du 15 minutter før kampstart, kommer du til at stå i kø. Ingen genindgang; der er et rygeområde i pausen uden for South Stand; trommer er ikke tilladt i udebaneafsnittet, og flag kræver forhåndsgodkendelse via safety@ccfc.co.uk. Car Park C er den nærmeste betalingsparkering til South Stand.","All away fixtures are all-ticket with no sales on the day; the away ticket collection window is next to the away turnstiles. Portman Road is cashless, including programmes (sold only outside the ground). Allow at least an extra hour for train travel because of frequent weekend engineering works, and check the club's match-specific guide sent to United about two weeks before the game; no re-admission.":"Alle udekampe kræver billet på forhånd, uden salg på dagen; udlevering af udebanebilletter sker ved lugen ved siden af udebanens tælleapparater. Portman Road er kontantfri, også for kampprogrammer (sælges kun uden for stadion). Beregn mindst en ekstra time til togrejsen på grund af hyppigt sporarbejde i weekenderne, og tjek klubbens kampspecifikke guide, der sendes til United cirka to uger før kampen; ingen genindgang.","Anfield is fully cashless (contactless or chip-and-PIN). Everyone is searched and pyro detection dogs may be present, so arrive early; fans without tickets are urged not to travel. Alcohol is served on the visiting concourse but cannot be consumed in view of the pitch, and the ground is no-smoking including e-cigarettes. Ticket collection: not stated (Ticket Office is under the Kop).":"Anfield er helt kontantfri (kontaktløst eller chip og PIN). Alle bliver visiteret, og der kan være hunde, der sporer pyroteknik, så kom i god tid; fans uden billet opfordres til ikke at rejse. Der serveres alkohol i udebanefansenes foyer, men det må ikke indtages med udsyn til banen, og stadion er røgfrit, også for e-cigaretter. Afhentning af billetter: ikke oplyst (billetkontoret ligger under The Kop).","Arrive no later than 60 minutes before kick-off; expect at least two search and ticket-check points on the approach. The Etihad is cashless. Pre-arranged ticket collections are at the South Stand Ticket Office from two hours before kick-off with photo ID, and tickets are not reprinted on the day, so arrange collection through United; download mobile tickets before arriving. No re-admission; under-14s must be with an adult.":"Ankom senest 60 minutter før kampstart; regn med mindst to visitations- og billettjekpunkter på vejen ind. Etihad er kontantfri. Forudaftalt billetudlevering sker ved South Stand Ticket Office fra to timer før kampstart med billed-ID, og billetter genudskrives ikke på dagen, så aftal udlevering via United; download mobilbilletter før ankomst. Ingen genindgang; børn under 14 skal være med en voksen.","Arsenal (Piccadilly line) is the nearest station, about three minutes' walk, but has no step-free access; Finsbury Park (Victoria and Piccadilly lines, Great Northern rail) and Highbury & Islington (Victoria line, Mildmay line, Great Northern rail) are each about a 10-minute walk. From King's Cross take the Piccadilly line to Arsenal or the Victoria line to Highbury & Islington. Holloway Road is exit-only before matches and eastbound trains do not stop there; Drayton Park is closed on matchdays. Buses stop on Holloway Road, Nag's Head, Seven Sisters Road, Blackstock Road and Highbury Corner; the club strongly advises against driving as an Event Day Parking Scheme covers the area.":"Arsenal (Piccadilly-linjen) er den nærmeste station, cirka tre minutters gang, men uden trinfri adgang; Finsbury Park (Victoria- og Piccadilly-linjen, Great Northern-tog) og Highbury & Islington (Victoria-linjen, Mildmay-linjen, Great Northern-tog) ligger hver cirka 10 minutters gang væk. Fra King's Cross tager du Piccadilly-linjen til Arsenal eller Victoria-linjen til Highbury & Islington. Holloway Road er kun udgang før kampe, og tog mod øst stopper ikke der; Drayton Park er lukket på kampdage. Busserne stopper på Holloway Road, Nag's Head, Seven Sisters Road, Blackstock Road og Highbury Corner; klubben fraråder kraftigt at køre i bil, da en parkeringsordning for kampdage dækker området.","Arsenal's pages name no pubs. Football Ground Guide names the Drayton Park pub (formerly the Drayton Arms, opposite the large ARSENAL letters, often called the away pub), the Twelve Pins near Finsbury Park station (away fans sometimes welcome in small groups) and The Coronet Wetherspoons on Holloway Road, all within a 10-minute walk, and suggests drinking in central London before taking the tube.":"Arsenals sider nævner ingen pubber. Football Ground Guide nævner Drayton Park-pubben (tidligere Drayton Arms, over for de store ARSENAL-bogstaver, ofte kaldt udebanepubben), Twelve Pins nær Finsbury Park-stationen (udebanefans er nogle gange velkomne i små grupper) og The Coronet Wetherspoons på Holloway Road, alle inden for 10 minutters gang, og foreslår at drikke i det centrale London, før man tager undergrunden.","At Tottenham's 2022 visit the away section was on two levels: level 0 blocks A9 and A11 (turnstile A) and level 4 blocks B7, B9, B11 and B13 (turnstile B), reached via Gate 1 with safety netting across the whole visiting area; you cannot move between levels. The standard UEFA allocation is around 2,500 and United's own travel guide will confirm the gate. Turnstiles open two hours before kick-off.":"Ved Tottenhams besøg i 2022 var udebaneafsnittet i to niveauer: niveau 0, blok A9 og A11 (tælleapparat A), og niveau 4, blok B7, B9, B11 og B13 (tælleapparat B), med adgang via Gate 1 og sikkerhedsnet over hele udebaneområdet; man kan ikke skifte mellem niveauerne. Den normale UEFA-tildeling er omkring 2,500, og Uniteds egen rejseguide bekræfter indgangen. Tælleapparaterne åbner to timer før kampstart.","Atkinson's first trophy, after losing the League Cup final to Liverpool in March. Brighton, already relegated, drew the final 2–2 — Gordon Smith's miss in the last minute of extra time became a radio catchphrase — and United won the replay 4–0 five days later with two from Robson. Norman Whiteside, 18, scored in both the League Cup and FA Cup finals that season.":"Atkinsons første trofæ, efter at have tabt Liga Cup-finalen til Liverpool i marts. Brighton, der allerede var rykket ned, spillede finalen 2–2 — Gordon Smiths brændte chance i sidste minut af den forlængede spilletid blev et radiomundheld — og United vandt omkampen 4–0 fem dage senere med to fra Robson. Norman Whiteside, 18, scorede i både Liga Cup- og FA Cup-finalen den sæson.","Away Ticket Office is beside turnstiles 91/92, open from 1.5 hours before kick-off; download digital tickets before arriving and charge your phone. Contactless is encouraged at kiosks, with cash accepted only at a limited number of locations. The Level 7 concourse sells burgers, pies, hot and cold drinks with vegetarian and halal options; alcohol is sold before kick-off and at half-time.":"Udebanebilletkontoret ligger ved tælleapparat 91/92 og åbner 1.5 timer før kampstart; download digitale billetter før ankomst, og oplad din telefon. Kontaktløs betaling opfordres til i kioskerne, og kontanter accepteres kun et begrænset antal steder. Foyeren på Level 7 sælger burgere, tærter, varme og kolde drikke med vegetariske og halal-muligheder; der sælges alkohol før kampstart og i pausen.","Away fans are discouraged from using Kew Bridge after the match; if you do, walk from Capital Interchange Way up Lionel Road South and join the same queue as home fans. Gunnersbury station does not open until an hour after the final whistle and queues are likely. Taxis take longer after the game. Last-train times: not stated.":"Udebanefans frarådes at bruge Kew Bridge efter kampen; gør du det alligevel, så gå fra Capital Interchange Way op ad Lionel Road South og stil dig i samme kø som hjemmefansene. Gunnersbury-stationen åbner først en time efter slutfløjtet, og der er sandsynligvis kø. Taxaer tager længere tid efter kampen. Sidste tog: ikke oplyst.","Away fans are held back for roughly 15 to 30 minutes after the final whistle until police release them; toilets and kiosks stay open. Return to the centre on the Green line from Telheiras, or stay on the away side of the stadium for taxis or Uber. Last metro times: not stated (the Lisbon metro normally runs until about 01:00 - unverified).":"Udebanefans holdes tilbage i cirka 15 til 30 minutter efter slutfløjtet, indtil politiet lukker dem ud; toiletter og kiosker holder åbent. Tag den grønne linje fra Telheiras tilbage til centrum, eller bliv på udebanesiden af stadion for taxa eller Uber. Sidste metro: ikke oplyst (Lissabons metro kører normalt til cirka 01:00 - ikke bekræftet).","Away fans are in the Bridgford Stand (lower Bridgford Block W is safe standing). Enter via the turnstile printed on your digital ticket - away turnstiles are in the range 41-53 behind the Bridgford Stand, next to the Visitors' Ticket Office. Turnstiles open 90 minutes before kick-off; most close 10 minutes after kick-off, a few stay open for late-comers. No re-entry.":"Udebanefans er i Bridgford Stand (nederste Bridgford Block W er ståpladser). Gå ind ved det tælleapparat, der står på din digitale billet - udebanens tælleapparater har numrene 41-53 bag Bridgford Stand, ved siden af billetkontoret for udebanefans. Tælleapparaterne åbner 90 minutter før kampstart; de fleste lukker 10 minutter efter kampstart, et par stykker holder åbent for sene ankomster. Ingen genindgang.","Away fans are in the Cobbold Stand, in blocks VU1, VU2 and VU3 (safe standing, upper tier) and VL and VA (seated); buy a seated ticket if you cannot stand for long periods, and there is no lift to the upper tier. Away turnstiles are 10/11, 12/13 and 14/15/16/17, with the away accessible entrance alongside; turnstiles open 90 minutes before daytime kick-offs and 75 minutes before evening games.":"Udebanefans er i Cobbold Stand, i blok VU1, VU2 og VU3 (ståpladser, øverste etage) og VL og VA (siddepladser); køb en siddeplads, hvis du ikke kan stå i længere tid, og der er ingen elevator til øverste etage. Udebanens tælleapparater er 10/11, 12/13 og 14/15/16/17, med udebanens handicapindgang ved siden af; tælleapparaterne åbner 90 minutter før kampstart i dagtimerne og 75 minutter før aftenkampe.","Away fans are in the East Stand (blocks N120, E115-E117 and E215-E218). Use away entrances F, G or H off Capital Interchange Way; turnstile G is the accessible entrance via a lift from Thomas Layton Way. Turnstiles open 90 minutes before kick-off and there is no re-entry.":"Udebanefans er i East Stand (blok N120, E115-E117 og E215-E218). Brug udebaneindgang F, G eller H fra Capital Interchange Way; tælleapparat G er handicapindgangen via en elevator fra Thomas Layton Way. Tælleapparaterne åbner 90 minutter før kampstart, og der er ingen genindgang.","Away fans are in the Shed End (South Stand), split across Shed Lower and Shed Upper, on the right-hand side as you face the stand; both are safe-standing rail-seat areas. The ticket office behind the Shed End next to the Megastore handles away enquiries. Entry readers open about 90 minutes before kick-off; the club does not publish turnstile letters.":"Udebanefans er i Shed End (South Stand), fordelt på Shed Lower og Shed Upper, i højre side, når man står med front mod tribunen; begge er ståpladsområder med rail seats. Billetkontoret bag Shed End ved siden af Megastore tager sig af henvendelser fra udebanefans. Billetscannerne åbner cirka 90 minutter før kampstart; klubben offentliggør ikke bogstaverne for tælleapparaterne.","Away fans are in the South Stand (blocks S1A/S1B to S1F), about 600 yards from Falmer station. Away tickets are processed through Entrance 28 (turnstile gates 28-31 were used for visiting fans in May 2026); turnstiles open 2 hours before kick-off.":"Udebanefans er i South Stand (blok S1A/S1B til S1F), cirka 600 yards fra Falmer-stationen. Udebanebilletter behandles via Indgang 28 (tælleapparat 28-31 blev brugt til udebanefans i maj 2026); tælleapparaterne åbner 2 timer før kampstart.","Away fans are in the South Stand (right-hand side behind the goal, across three tiers) and should use entrances L1, L2 and L3, which open two hours before kick-off; the first two tiers are preferred for the view. Away coaches park in the Grey Car Park opposite the away turnstiles.":"Udebanefans er i South Stand (højre side bag målet, over tre etager) og skal bruge indgang L1, L2 og L3, som åbner to timer før kampstart; de to nederste etager foretrækkes for udsigtens skyld. Udebanebusserne holder på Grey Car Park over for udebanens tælleapparater.","Away fans are in the South Stand, usually blocks 6-9, with safe standing in blocks 6 and 7 and a wheelchair platform at the front of block 8 accessed via Gate 25; the South Stand is not connected to the other stands. Specific turnstile numbers are shown on your ticket; turnstiles open 90 minutes before kick-off and the away late turnstile is number 5.":"Udebanefans er i South Stand, normalt blok 6-9, med ståpladser i blok 6 og 7 og en kørestolsplatform forrest i blok 8 med adgang via Gate 25; South Stand er ikke forbundet med de andre tribuner. De konkrete numre på tælleapparaterne står på din billet; tælleapparaterne åbner 90 minutter før kampstart, og udebanens tælleapparat for sene ankomster er nummer 5.","Away fans are in the Vitality East Stand, blocks 21 to 24, in one corner of the stand, entered via Turnstile F; there is an away-accessible entrance next to the away turnstiles. Turnstiles open 90 minutes before kick-off.":"Udebanefans er i Vitality East Stand, blok 21 til 24, i det ene hjørne af tribunen, med adgang via Turnstile F; der er en handicapindgang for udebanefans ved siden af udebanens tælleapparater. Tælleapparaterne åbner 90 minutter før kampstart.","Away fans are in the lower tier of the south-east corner, between the East Stand and the Clock End (just under 3000 for Premier League games). Enter via turnstiles K and L at the south-east corner; turnstiles open 120 minutes before kick-off and Arsenal recommends arriving at least 60 minutes before kick-off, using the Clock End Bridge from Arsenal station as it is quieter than the North Bank Bridge.":"Udebanefans er på nederste etage i det sydøstlige hjørne, mellem East Stand og Clock End (knap 3000 til Premier League-kampe). Gå ind ved tælleapparat K og L i det sydøstlige hjørne; tælleapparaterne åbner 120 minutter før kampstart, og Arsenal anbefaler at ankomme mindst 60 minutter før kampstart og bruge Clock End Bridge fra Arsenal-stationen, da den er roligere end North Bank Bridge.","Away fans are in the north-east corner of the Doug Ellis Stand: Doug Ellis Lower Block Q (about 1600 seats) via turnstiles Q91-Q96B, and Doug Ellis Upper Block P (about 1300 seats) via turnstiles P87, P88, P88A and P89 (64 steps to the upper concourse). Turnstiles open about 90 minutes before kick-off; late arrivals can use Q96 and/or P89 until the second half starts.":"Udebanefans er i det nordøstlige hjørne af Doug Ellis Stand: Doug Ellis Lower Block Q (cirka 1600 pladser) via tælleapparat Q91-Q96B og Doug Ellis Upper Block P (cirka 1300 pladser) via tælleapparat P87, P88, P88A og P89 (64 trin op til den øverste foyer). Tælleapparaterne åbner cirka 90 minutter før kampstart; sene ankomster kan bruge Q96 og/eller P89, indtil anden halvleg starter.","Away fans are in the upper tier of the Fondo Norte (North Stand) behind the goal, a steep tier used exclusively for visitors; allocations are small (around 1,100-1,200 is typical). For United's 2021 visit the entry point was Gate 25; the away gate is confirmed by United per fixture, with ID and bag checks at several cordons.":"Udebanefans er på øverste etage af Fondo Norte (North Stand) bag målet, en stejl etage, der udelukkende bruges til gæster; tildelingerne er små (typisk omkring 1,100-1,200). Ved Uniteds besøg i 2021 var indgangen Gate 25; udebaneindgangen bekræftes af United for hver kamp, med ID- og tasketjek ved flere afspærringer.","Away fans are in the upper tier of the North Stand, entering through turnstiles 69-74, which open 90 minutes before kick-off. Fans needing lift access should go to the 76 Yards entrance and ask stewards for the lift to level 3. Standard away allocation is around 3000.":"Udebanefans er på øverste etage af North Stand med adgang gennem tælleapparat 69-74, som åbner 90 minutter før kampstart. Fans, der har brug for elevator, skal gå til 76 Yards-indgangen og bede stewarderne om elevatoren til niveau 3. Den normale udebanetildeling er omkring 3000.","Away fans are on Level 7 of the Leazes Stand (the Leazes End, top tier), reached by 140 steps and 14 landings with a lift available on request from a steward. Use turnstiles 89-94 in the Leazes Stand (normally 91-94) according to the access number on your ticket; turnstiles open 90 minutes before kick-off and step-free access is near turnstiles 93-94.":"Udebanefans er på Level 7 i Leazes Stand (Leazes End, øverste etage), som nås ad 140 trin og 14 reposer, med elevator efter anmodning hos en steward. Brug tælleapparat 89-94 i Leazes Stand (normalt 91-94) ud fra adgangsnummeret på din billet; tælleapparaterne åbner 90 minutter før kampstart, og trinfri adgang findes ved tælleapparat 93-94.","Away fans may be held back briefly after the final whistle while nearby areas clear, by agreement with Greater Manchester Police, with PA announcements. Tram queues at Etihad Campus can be up to 30 minutes and many fans prefer the 25-30 minute walk back to Piccadilly along the A662; TfGM also runs post-match shuttle buses. Last trains to London: not stated.":"Udebanefans kan blive holdt kortvarigt tilbage efter slutfløjtet, mens områderne omkring ryddes, efter aftale med Greater Manchester Police, med højttalerudkald. Køen til sporvognen ved Etihad Campus kan vare op til 30 minutter, og mange fans foretrækker at gå de 25-30 minutter tilbage til Piccadilly langs A662; TfGM kører også shuttlebusser efter kampen. Sidste tog til London: ikke oplyst.","Away fixtures, allocations and ballot dates read from the away-tickets page on tickets.manutd.com on 29 Oct 2026; away kick-off dates are the TV-selected ones and may still move. Home fixtures, kick-offs and seat availability read from tickets.manutd.com on 2 Nov 2026 (1 adult, logged in as an Official Member); blocks sell out and get released, so check before booking. Flight and hotel prices were checked on SlickTrip on 29 Oct 2026 for 1 adult and will have moved; round-trip fares are \"from\" prices pairing the named outbound with its cheapest return. Hotels are 4-star and up only (Hotel Football, the Marriott family, the high-end city hotels and those near the ground); prices are for the exact fixture night, cheapest room, 1 adult, and the hotel's own page shows the live rate and all sellers. Weather is the Open-Meteo forecast inside 16 days, otherwise Manchester's seasonal averages. Hosted versions of this page fetch live weather; some embedded viewers block it.":"Udekampe, tildelinger og lodtrækningsdatoer læst fra siden med udebanebilletter på tickets.manutd.com den 29. okt. 2026; datoer for udekampe er de tv-valgte og kan stadig flytte. Hjemmekampe, kampstarter og ledige pladser læst fra tickets.manutd.com den 2. nov. 2026 (1 voksen, logget ind som Official Member); blokke bliver udsolgt og frigivet igen, så tjek før du booker. Fly- og hotelpriser blev tjekket på SlickTrip den 29. okt. 2026 for 1 voksen og har flyttet sig; returbilletter er \"fra\"-priser, der parrer den nævnte udrejse med den billigste hjemrejse. Kun hoteller med 4 stjerner og derover (Hotel Football, Marriott-familien, de dyre hoteller i centrum og dem nær stadion); priserne er for præcis kampnatten, billigste værelse, 1 voksen, og hotellets egen side viser den aktuelle pris og alle forhandlere. Vejret er Open-Meteos prognose inden for 16 dage, ellers Manchesters sæsongennemsnit. Hostede versioner af siden henter live-vejr; nogle indlejrede visere blokerer det.","Bags larger than A4 (the prohibited items list gives 10x20x30cm) are not permitted and there is no bag storage at the stadium; medical exemptions must be arranged in advance via accessibility@nufc.co.uk and no exemption is given for travel or accommodation reasons. Banned items include glass, canned drinks, weapons, pyrotechnics, smoke canisters, air horns, lasers, drums, flag poles, prams and video recording equipment; all bags and people are searched.":"Tasker større end A4 (listen over forbudte genstande angiver 10x20x30cm) er ikke tilladt, og der er ingen taskeopbevaring på stadion; medicinske undtagelser skal aftales på forhånd via accessibility@nufc.co.uk, og der gives ingen undtagelse af hensyn til rejse eller overnatning. Forbudte genstande omfatter glas, dåsedrikke, våben, pyroteknik, røgbomber, trykluftshorn, lasere, trommer, flagstænger, barnevogne og videooptageudstyr; alle tasker og personer visiteres.","Bags must be no bigger than A4 and all bags are searched; the club advises not bringing one unless necessary. Banned items include alcohol, cans, glass and flasks, air horns, lasers, pyrotechnics, umbrellas, large bags or cabin bags, large-lens cameras, selfie sticks and flags over 2m x 1m (flags need a fire certificate and no poles). No bag storage is mentioned.":"Tasker må ikke være større end A4, og alle tasker visiteres; klubben råder til ikke at tage en med, medmindre det er nødvendigt. Forbudte genstande omfatter alkohol, dåser, glas og termokander, trykluftshorn, lasere, pyroteknik, paraplyer, store tasker eller kabinekufferter, kameraer med store objektiver, selfiestænger og flag over 2m x 1m (flag kræver brandcertifikat og ingen stænger). Taskeopbevaring nævnes ikke.","Bags up to A4 size (20cm x 30cm) are admitted after a search; there is no bag storage. Alcohol, bottles, cans, food, flagpoles, umbrellas, radios and footballs are banned; power banks are allowed; poleless flags up to 1m x 1m need a fire certificate. No alcohol is sold in general admission areas.":"Tasker op til A4-størrelse (20cm x 30cm) må medbringes efter visitation; der er ingen taskeopbevaring. Alkohol, flasker, dåser, mad, flagstænger, paraplyer, radioer og fodbolde er forbudt; powerbanks er tilladt; flag uden stang op til 1m x 1m kræver brandcertifikat. Der sælges ikke alkohol i de almindelige tribuneområder.","Brentford strongly recommend not bringing a bag; maximum size is 34cm x 24cm x 11cm, measured by stewards, with no folding to fit. Oversized bags, suitcases, prams and buggies can only be stored at the Bees Superstore (opens 2 hours before kick-off), £5 per item or £10 for the largest bags and suitcases, and must be collected by the time on your storage ticket. Prohibited items include alcohol, cans, glass or dark plastic bottles, water over 500ml, laptops and tablets, large cameras, air horns, flares and poles; small folding umbrellas and flags up to 2m x 1m are allowed.":"Brentford anbefaler kraftigt ikke at tage en taske med; den maksimale størrelse er 34cm x 24cm x 11cm, målt af stewarderne, og den må ikke foldes for at passe. Overdimensionerede tasker, kufferter, barnevogne og klapvogne kan kun opbevares i Bees Superstore (åbner 2 timer før kampstart), £5 pr. genstand eller £10 for de største tasker og kufferter, og skal hentes inden tidspunktet på din opbevaringsbillet. Forbudte genstande omfatter alkohol, dåser, glas eller mørke plastflasker, vand over 500ml, bærbare og tablets, store kameraer, trykluftshorn, nødblus og stænger; små sammenklappelige paraplyer og flag op til 2m x 1m er tilladt.","Busby's fifth and last title, unbeaten at home all season and sealed with a 6–1 win at West Ham on the penultimate Saturday. It put United back into the European Cup, which is what the season was really for. Alex Stepney, signed from Chelsea in September for £55,000, was the final piece.":"Busbys femte og sidste mesterskab, ubesejret hjemme hele sæsonen og sikret med en 6–1-sejr hos West Ham den næstsidste lørdag. Det bragte United tilbage i Mesterholdenes Europa Cup, som var det, sæsonen i virkeligheden handlede om. Alex Stepney, hentet fra Chelsea i september for £55,000, var den sidste brik.","Busby's first trophy, three years after he took the job, and still playing home games at Maine Road while Old Trafford was rebuilt after the bombing. Every round was drawn away or at a neutral ground, with 3–0 wins over Aston Villa (after 6–4 in the third round), Liverpool, Charlton, Preston and Derby. The final against Blackpool is still spoken of as one of Wembley's best: 2–1 down with twenty minutes left, United scored three.":"Busbys første trofæ, tre år efter han tog jobbet, og stadig med hjemmekampe på Maine Road, mens Old Trafford blev genopbygget efter bombningen. Hver runde blev trukket ude eller på neutral bane, med 3–0-sejre over Aston Villa (efter 6–4 i tredje runde), Liverpool, Charlton, Preston og Derby. Finalen mod Blackpool omtales stadig som en af Wembleys bedste: bagud 1–2 med tyve minutter igen scorede United tre.","Carry photo ID (passport) with your ticket; checks happen at police cordons and turnstiles. Gates open 90 minutes to two hours before kick-off; arrive early for the security checks. Tickets are print-at-home, personal and non-transferable, sent about five days before the match; do not book travel until you have one, as kick-off times can change.":"Medbring billed-ID (pas) sammen med din billet; der er tjek ved politiets afspærringer og ved tælleapparaterne. Indgangene åbner 90 minutter til to timer før kampstart; kom tidligt på grund af sikkerhedstjekket. Billetterne er print-selv, personlige og kan ikke overdrages og sendes cirka fem dage før kampen; book ikke rejsen, før du har en, da kampstarten kan ændres.","Champions League quarter-final, second leg, Old Trafford. Van Nistelrooy 43, Helguera 52 (og), Beckham 71, 85; Ronaldo 12, 50, 59. Out of Europe, but the night Ronaldo was applauded off by Old Trafford and Beckham scored twice from the bench. Included because the season is unexplained without it. Ronaldo's hat-trick and a standing ovation from the Stretford End; Beckham off the bench with two. Won the night, lost the tie 5–6.":"Champions League-kvartfinale, 2. kamp, Old Trafford. Van Nistelrooy 43, Helguera 52 (selvm.), Beckham 71, 85; Ronaldo 12, 50, 59. Ude af Europa, men aftenen hvor Ronaldo fik klapsalver fra Old Trafford, og Beckham scorede to gange fra bænken. Med, fordi sæsonen ikke kan forklares uden den. Ronaldos hattrick og stående ovationer fra Stretford End; Beckham ind fra bænken med to. Vandt kampen, tabte opgøret 5–6.","Champions League semi-final, second leg, Stadio delle Alpi. Keane 24, Yorke 34, Cole 83; Inzaghi 6, 11. Two down after eleven minutes. Keane's header, then his booking for a foul on Zidane. Inzaghi twice inside 11 minutes. Keane's header, Yorke's diving header and Cole's late winner, with Keane booked and out of the final — the night Ferguson called the most courageous performance he had seen.":"Champions League-semifinale, 2. kamp, Stadio delle Alpi. Keane 24, Yorke 34, Cole 83; Inzaghi 6, 11. To mål bagud efter elleve minutter. Keanes hovedstød og så hans gule kort for en tackling på Zidane. Inzaghi to gange inden for 11 minutter. Keanes hovedstød, Yorkes flyvende hovedstød og Coles sene sejrsmål, med Keane advaret og ude af finalen — aftenen, hvor Ferguson kaldte det den mest modige præstation, han havde set.","Click a year above for the full season: every trophy that year, the decisive matches with scorers and line-ups, and — from 2010 — statistics and events from the match data. Highlight links open the club's official YouTube channel search.":"Klik på et år ovenfor for hele sæsonen: hvert trofæ det år, de afgørende kampe med målscorere og opstillinger og — fra 2010 — statistik og hændelser fra kampdataene. Links til højdepunkter åbner en søgning på klubbens officielle YouTube-kanal.","Club profile from Wikipedia, CC BY-SA 4.0. Head-to-head figures cover every competitive meeting: league and FA Cup from the match archive, League Cup, European and other cup ties from the Wikipedia season articles (1956/57 on, CC BY-SA 4.0), and the live feed from 2021/22 for cups and 2025/26 for everything. Wartime and friendly matches are not included.":"Klubprofil fra Wikipedia, CC BY-SA 4.0. Tallene for indbyrdes opgør dækker alle officielle kampe: liga og FA Cup fra kamparkivet, Liga Cup, europæiske og andre pokalkampe fra Wikipedias sæsonartikler (fra 1956/57, CC BY-SA 4.0), og live-feedet fra 2021/22 for pokalturneringer og 2025/26 for alt. Krigstids- og venskabskampe er ikke medtaget.","Cristiano Ronaldo's first season and first trophy. Arsenal went the league unbeaten, but United knocked them out of the FA Cup in the semi-final at Villa Park with Scholes's goal, then beat Millwall 3–0 in the first final in Cardiff. Ronaldo, 19, headed the first; Van Nistelrooy scored a penalty and a second. Rio Ferdinand began an eight-month ban in January for a missed drugs test.":"Cristiano Ronaldos første sæson og første trofæ. Arsenal gik ubesejret gennem ligaen, men United slog dem ud af FA Cup'en i semifinalen på Villa Park med Scholes' mål og slog derefter Millwall 3–0 i den første finale i Cardiff. Ronaldo, 19, headede det første ind; Van Nistelrooy scorede på straffespark og et mål mere. Rio Ferdinand begyndte i januar en otte måneders karantæne for en udeblevet dopingtest.","Each match links to the site's match centre (events and line-ups, 2010/11 on) and to the report the Wikipedia season article cites — BBC or manutd.com for most games since 1999 — or, before that, to the season article itself.":"Hver kamp linker til sidens kampcenter (hændelser og opstillinger, fra 2010/11) og til det referat, Wikipedias sæsonartikel henviser til — BBC eller manutd.com for de fleste kampe siden 1999 — eller, før det, til selve sæsonartiklen.","Eight points behind Arsenal at the start of March, champions by five. Van Nistelrooy scored in ten consecutive league games at the end of the season and 44 in all; Ferguson had been due to retire the previous summer and changed his mind. The turning point was Arsenal's 2–2 draw at Bolton on 26 April and their loss to Leeds a week later; Beckham played his last United game in the final match and left for Real Madrid that summer.":"Otte point efter Arsenal i starten af marts, mestre med fem. Van Nistelrooy scorede i ti ligakampe i træk i slutningen af sæsonen og 44 i alt; Ferguson skulle have stoppet sommeren før, men ombestemte sig. Vendepunktet var Arsenals 2–2 i Bolton den 26. april og deres nederlag til Leeds en uge senere; Beckham spillede sin sidste kamp for United i sæsonens sidste kamp og skiftede til Real Madrid samme sommer.","English clubs were back in Europe after the five-year ban and United won the Cup Winners' Cup at the first attempt, beating Pécsi Munkás, Wrexham, Montpellier and Legia Warsaw, then Johan Cruyff's Barcelona in Rotterdam. Hughes, sold by Barcelona five years earlier, scored both. Lee Sharpe, 19, was PFA Young Player of the Year; the League Cup final was lost to Sheffield Wednesday.":"Engelske klubber var tilbage i Europa efter den femårige udelukkelse, og United vandt Pokalvindernes Europa Cup i første forsøg med sejre over Pécsi Munkás, Wrexham, Montpellier og Legia Warszawa og derefter Johan Cruyffs Barcelona i Rotterdam. Hughes, som Barcelona havde solgt fem år tidligere, scorede begge. Lee Sharpe, 19, blev kåret som PFA Young Player of the Year; Liga Cup-finalen blev tabt til Sheffield Wednesday.","European Cup semi-final, second leg, Bernabéu. Sadler 73, Foulkes 78; Pirri 32, Gento 41, Amancio 45 (Zoco og 42). 3–1 down on the night at half-time, 3–2 behind on aggregate; Busby told them they were only one goal away.":"Mesterholdenes Europa Cup-semifinale, 2. kamp, Bernabéu. Sadler 73, Foulkes 78; Pirri 32, Gento 41, Amancio 45 (Zoco selvm. 42). 1–3 i kampen ved pausen, 2–3 bagud samlet; Busby sagde til dem, at de kun var ét mål fra.","Event data from API-Football; classics from the club's records. \"Two goals down\" means United trailed by two or more and did not lose; \"injury-time winner\" is a winning goal in stoppage time; \"ten men\" is a United red card before the 75th minute in a match not lost.":"Hændelsesdata fra API-Football; klassikerne fra klubbens egne optegnelser. \"To mål bagud\" betyder, at United var bagud med to eller flere og ikke tabte; \"sejrsmål i overtiden\" er et sejrsmål i tillægstiden; \"ti mand\" er et rødt kort til United før det 75. minut i en kamp, der ikke blev tabt.","Every away ground on this season's list. Each guide is written from the host club's own supporter pages and one away-travel source, with the date it was last checked shown on the guide — clubs change bag rules and turnstiles, so check the date before you rely on it.":"Alle udebanestadioner på sæsonens liste. Hver guide er skrevet ud fra værtsklubbens egne fansider og én kilde om udebaneture, med datoen for seneste tjek vist på guiden — klubber ændrer taskeregler og tælleapparater, så tjek datoen, før du stoler på den.","Everyone whose first appearance in a United squad list came in one of his seasons, from the squad-number records (1994/95 on). Signings and academy graduates both appear; a player who arrived mid-season under a successor will show against the manager who started that season.":"Alle, hvis første optræden på en United-trupliste kom i en af hans sæsoner, ud fra trupnummerdataene (fra 1994/95). Både købte spillere og akademiprodukter er med; en spiller, der kom midt i sæsonen under en efterfølger, står under den manager, der startede sæsonen.","Everything on this page is computed from the match archive: league and FA Cup from engsoccerdata, League Cup, European and other cup ties from the Wikipedia season articles (CC BY-SA 4.0), and the live feed for recent seasons. No wartime, friendly or pre-League games, so the archive begins with Newton Heath's first League season, 1892/93.":"Alt på denne side er beregnet ud fra kamparkivet: liga og FA Cup fra engsoccerdata, Liga Cup, europæiske og andre pokalkampe fra Wikipedias sæsonartikler (CC BY-SA 4.0), og live-feedet for de seneste sæsoner. Ingen krigstids-, venskabs- eller kampe før ligaen, så arkivet begynder med Newton Heaths første ligasæson, 1892/93.","FA Cup semi-final replay, Maine Road. Irwin, Kanchelskis, Robson, Giggs; Pointon. Three days after Hughes's volley in the 119th minute had saved the first match at Wembley. Pointon put Oldham ahead in extra time; Hughes' volley with a minute of it left kept the Double alive. United won the replay 4–1.":"FA Cup-semifinale, omkamp, Maine Road. Irwin, Kanchelskis, Robson, Giggs; Pointon. Tre dage efter at Hughes' volley i det 119. minut havde reddet den første kamp på Wembley. Pointon bragte Oldham foran i den forlængede spilletid; Hughes' volley med et minut tilbage holdt The Double i live. United vandt omkampen 4–1.","FA Cup semi-final replay, Villa Park. Beckham 17, Giggs 109; Bergkamp 69. Keane sent off, Schmeichel saved Bergkamp's penalty in the last minute, then Giggs took the ball from Vieira in his own half and beat five players. Beckham's opener, Bergkamp's equaliser, Keane sent off, Schmeichel saves Bergkamp's last-minute penalty, then Giggs runs through half the Arsenal defence in extra time.":"FA Cup-semifinale, omkamp, Villa Park. Beckham 17, Giggs 109; Bergkamp 69. Keane udvist, Schmeichel reddede Bergkamps straffespark i sidste minut, og så erobrede Giggs bolden fra Vieira på egen banehalvdel og driblede fem spillere af. Beckhams 1–0, Bergkamps udligning, Keane udvist, Schmeichel redder Bergkamps straffespark i sidste minut, og så løber Giggs gennem halvdelen af Arsenals forsvar i den forlængede spilletid.","Falmer station queues can take up to 50 minutes to clear and buses fill fast; the South Stand concourse stays open for an hour after the match and the North Stand bar is open to both sets of fans, so waiting is an option. Park & Ride buses run back up to 90 minutes after the game. Free rail travel covers journeys started within 3.5 hours of the final whistle; last-train times to London or Manchester: not stated.":"Køerne ved Falmer-stationen kan tage op til 50 minutter at komme igennem, og busserne fyldes hurtigt; South Stand-foyeren holder åben i en time efter kampen, og baren i North Stand er åben for begge holds fans, så man kan vente. Park & Ride-busserne kører tilbage op til 90 minutter efter kampen. Gratis togrejse gælder for rejser påbegyndt inden for 3.5 timer efter slutfløjtet; sidste tog til London eller Manchester: ikke oplyst.","Ferguson's 13th title and his last, a year after the Agüero goal had taken the 2012 championship on goal difference. Van Persie, 29, signed from Arsenal for £24m, scored 26 and won the Golden Boot; the title was clinched with four games left on 22 April with his hat-trick against Aston Villa, the second a volley from Rooney's long pass. Ferguson announced his retirement on 8 May; his last match was a 5–5 at West Brom.":"Fergusons 13. og sidste mesterskab, et år efter at Agüeros mål havde taget mesterskabet i 2012 på målforskel. Van Persie, 29, hentet fra Arsenal for £24m, scorede 26 og vandt Den Gyldne Støvle; mesterskabet blev sikret med fire kampe tilbage den 22. april med hans hattrick mod Aston Villa, det andet en volley på Rooneys lange aflevering. Ferguson annoncerede sit farvel den 8. maj; hans sidste kamp var 5–5 ude mod West Brom.","Figures from API-Football via this site's Worker; the report rebuilds every six hours and archives one copy a week. Academy games (U18 / U21 / youth cups) are not in the feed, so a player only appears here once he is in a first-team squad or out on loan.":"Tal fra API-Football via sidens Worker; rapporten genopbygges hver sjette time og arkiverer én kopi om ugen. Akademikampe (U18 / U21 / ungdomsturneringer) er ikke i feedet, så en spiller dukker først op her, når han er i en førsteholdstrup eller udlejet.","Finals line-ups from the Wikipedia match articles (CC BY-SA 4.0). Season figures from the Wikipedia season articles (CC BY-SA 4.0), all competitions; the current season is live from API-Football. Where two players share a number in one season (a transfer), both are listed.":"Finaleopstillinger fra Wikipedias kampartikler (CC BY-SA 4.0). Sæsontal fra Wikipedias sæsonartikler (CC BY-SA 4.0), alle turneringer; den aktuelle sæson er live fra API-Football. Hvor to spillere deler et nummer i samme sæson (et klubskifte), er begge med.","Five years after Munich, the first trophy of the rebuilt side — and in a season the league form nearly took United down. Law, bought from Torino for a British record £115,000, scored in the final against Leicester, who had finished fourth and were favourites. David Herd got the other two. It was the beginning of the Law–Charlton–Best side; Best made his debut that September.":"Fem år efter München, det genopbyggede holds første trofæ — og i en sæson, hvor ligaformen nær havde sendt United ned. Law, købt fra Torino for britisk rekordbeløb på £115,000, scorede i finalen mod Leicester, som var sluttet som nr. 4 og var favoritter. David Herd lavede de to andre. Det var begyndelsen på Law–Charlton–Best-holdet; Best fik sin debut i september.","Fixture dates from tickets.manutd.com (home) and the TV-selected lists (away) on 29 Oct 2026. Live table, results and form from API-Football via this site's own Worker; nothing is fetched from the user's browser except this site and flag images.":"Kampdatoer fra tickets.manutd.com (hjemme) og de TV-udvalgte lister (ude) den 29. okt. 2026. Live-stilling, resultater og form fra API-Football via sidens egen Worker; intet hentes fra brugerens browser undtagen denne side og flagbilleder.","Four stations serve the ground: White Hart Lane (Overground from Liverpool Street, about 5 minutes' walk), Northumberland Park (Greater Anglia from Liverpool Street and Stratford, about 10 minutes, and the station the club steers away fans towards; the away entrances are on Worcester Avenue via Park Lane), Tottenham Hale (Victoria line plus Greater Anglia, about 25 minutes) and Seven Sisters (Victoria line and Overground, about 30 minutes, no step-free access). The Victoria line is very crowded before weeknight games and trains sometimes skip Seven Sisters. Buses 149, 249, 279 and 349 run up the High Road, though routes are diverted by road closures. Taxis cannot drop off near the stadium; arrange a point at least 15 minutes' walk away.":"Fire stationer betjener stadion: White Hart Lane (Overground fra Liverpool Street, cirka 5 minutters gang), Northumberland Park (Greater Anglia fra Liverpool Street og Stratford, cirka 10 minutter, og den station, klubben henviser udebanefans til; udebaneindgangene ligger på Worcester Avenue via Park Lane), Tottenham Hale (Victoria-linjen plus Greater Anglia, cirka 25 minutter) og Seven Sisters (Victoria-linjen og Overground, cirka 30 minutter, uden trinfri adgang). Victoria-linjen er meget fyldt før kampe på hverdagsaftener, og togene springer nogle gange Seven Sisters over. Bus 149, 249, 279 og 349 kører op ad High Road, men ruterne omlægges på grund af vejlukninger. Taxaer kan ikke sætte af tæt på stadion; aftal et sted mindst 15 minutters gang væk.","Four times runners-up in five years, Busby's first great side finally took the title in Carey's last season. It came down to the final day against Arsenal at Old Trafford, who needed to win 7–0 to overhaul United's goal average; United won 6–1. Rowley scored a hat-trick and finished with 30 league goals. Roger Byrne, 22, played the run-in at outside-left — the first of the Babes.":"Fire gange nr. 2 på fem år, men Busbys første store hold vandt endelig mesterskabet i Careys sidste sæson. Det blev afgjort i sidste spillerunde mod Arsenal på Old Trafford, som skulle vinde 7–0 for at overhale Uniteds målkvotient; United vandt 6–1. Rowley lavede hattrick og sluttede med 30 ligamål. Roger Byrne, 22, spillede slutspurten som venstre wing — den første af Busby Babes.","From 1939 to 1993 the shirt went with the position: 1 goalkeeper, 2 and 3 full-backs, 4–6 half-backs, 7–11 forwards. Nobody owned a number, so the record is match by match, from the line-ups in Wikipedia's article on each final.":"Fra 1939 til 1993 fulgte trøjen positionen: 1 målmand, 2 og 3 backs, 4–6 halfbacks, 7–11 angribere. Ingen ejede et nummer, så data er kamp for kamp, ud fra opstillingerne i Wikipedias artikel om hver finale.","From Birmingham New Street take a local train (10-15 minutes, extra services on matchdays) to Witton, the nearest station to the away turnstiles - turn left out of the station, down to the roundabout, then left into Witton Lane for the away entrance a few minutes' walk away. Aston station is the alternative, about a 10-15 minute walk. Villa also run a matchday express city centre shuttle bus from Dudley Street (near New Street station) to Villa Park, open to home and away fans. Street parking around the ground is residents-only with £60 fines, and a traffic exclusion zone covers Witton Lane and Trinity Road from 2 hours before kick-off to 30-60 minutes after.":"Fra Birmingham New Street tager du et lokaltog (10-15 minutter, ekstra afgange på kampdage) til Witton, den nærmeste station til udebaneindgangene - drej til venstre ud af stationen, ned til rundkørslen og så til venstre ad Witton Lane til udebaneindgangen få minutters gang væk. Aston-stationen er alternativet, cirka 10-15 minutters gang. Villa kører også en ekspres-shuttlebus på kampdage fra Dudley Street (nær New Street-stationen) til Villa Park, åben for både hjemme- og udebanefans. Gadeparkering omkring stadion er kun for beboere med bøder på £60, og en trafikforbudszone dækker Witton Lane og Trinity Road fra 2 timer før kampstart til 30-60 minutter efter.","From Heathrow take the Piccadilly line direct to Arsenal (about 1 hour 10 minutes); from Gatwick take a train to Victoria then the Victoria line to Highbury & Islington (about 1 hour 15 minutes); from Luton or Stansted take a train to King's Cross St Pancras then the Piccadilly line to Arsenal (about 1 hour).":"Fra Heathrow tager du Piccadilly-linjen direkte til Arsenal (cirka 1 time og 10 minutter); fra Gatwick tager du tog til Victoria og så Victoria-linjen til Highbury & Islington (cirka 1 time og 15 minutter); fra Luton eller Stansted tager du tog til King's Cross St Pancras og så Piccadilly-linjen til Arsenal (cirka 1 time).","From Liverpool Lime Street the ground is around two miles away; the club says a taxi from the city centre is usually £8-£10. The 917 Express bus runs from Commutation Row (near Lime Street) in about 15 minutes, and routes 26 (Liverpool ONE), 17 (Queen Square), 68/168, 14 and 19 also stop nearby; a matchday 926 service starts 3.5 hours before kick-off from Liverpool ONE. By Merseyrail, go to Sandhills and take the Soccerbus, which runs from 2 hours before kick-off. Kirkdale is the closest station (just under a mile); Stanley Park car park is permit holders only.":"Fra Liverpool Lime Street ligger stadion cirka to miles væk; klubben siger, at en taxa fra centrum normalt koster £8-£10. 917 Express-bussen kører fra Commutation Row (nær Lime Street) på cirka 15 minutter, og linje 26 (Liverpool ONE), 17 (Queen Square), 68/168, 14 og 19 stopper også i nærheden; en kampdagsrute 926 starter 3.5 timer før kampstart fra Liverpool ONE. Med Merseyrail kører du til Sandhills og tager Soccerbus, som kører fra 2 timer før kampstart. Kirkdale er den nærmeste station (knap en mile); Stanley Park-parkeringspladsen er kun for indehavere af tilladelse.","Fulham Broadway is very crowded after the game and its entrance has been closed at full time; wait a few minutes or walk to Earl's Court, West Kensington, West Brompton, Gloucester Road or South Kensington instead. Last train times to Manchester: not stated.":"Fulham Broadway er meget fyldt efter kampen, og indgangen har været lukket ved slutfløjtet; vent et par minutter, eller gå i stedet til Earl's Court, West Kensington, West Brompton, Gloucester Road eller South Kensington. Sidste tog til Manchester: ikke oplyst.","Gatwick is the practical airport: a direct train runs to Norwood Junction, or a taxi of 30-40 minutes. From Heathrow, take the Heathrow Express or Piccadilly line into London and connect to Selhurst, Thornton Heath or Norwood Junction (taxi 45-60 minutes).":"Gatwick er den praktiske lufthavn: et direkte tog kører til Norwood Junction, eller en taxa på 30-40 minutter. Fra Heathrow tager du Heathrow Express eller Piccadilly-linjen ind til London og skifter til Selhurst, Thornton Heath eller Norwood Junction (taxa 45-60 minutter).","Holloway Road station is closed for up to two hours after the match, so use Arsenal, Finsbury Park or Highbury & Islington, all with managed post-match queuing. Arsenal station queues can mean a wait of at least 30 minutes, so consider walking to Finsbury Park; the club advises arriving early and leaving later to avoid crowds. Last trains to Manchester: not stated.":"Holloway Road-stationen er lukket i op til to timer efter kampen, så brug Arsenal, Finsbury Park eller Highbury & Islington, som alle har styret kø efter kampen. Køen ved Arsenal-stationen kan betyde mindst 30 minutters ventetid, så overvej at gå til Finsbury Park; klubben råder til at komme tidligt og gå senere for at undgå trængsel. Sidste tog til Manchester: ikke oplyst.","Kew Bridge is the nearest station (South Western Railway from London Waterloo, about every 15 minutes on matchday Saturdays, not step-free). Brentford station is the nearest step-free station, about 20 minutes' walk. Gunnersbury (District line and London Overground) is also close but has a small platform with restricted access at busy times; Kew Gardens, Chiswick Park, South Acton, Acton Town and South Ealing are other options - eight stations are within a 20-minute walk. Buses 65, 110, 237, 267, H91 and 391 serve the stadium. Taxis and Uber are available but expect longer waits after the match.":"Kew Bridge er den nærmeste station (South Western Railway fra London Waterloo, cirka hvert 15. minut på kamplørdage, ikke trinfri). Brentford-stationen er den nærmeste trinfri station, cirka 20 minutters gang. Gunnersbury (District-linjen og London Overground) ligger også tæt på, men har en lille perron med begrænset adgang i myldretiden; Kew Gardens, Chiswick Park, South Acton, Acton Town og South Ealing er andre muligheder - otte stationer ligger inden for 20 minutters gang. Bus 65, 110, 237, 267, H91 og 391 kører til stadion. Taxa og Uber findes, men regn med længere ventetid efter kampen.","Kit images from the site's own archive. Manufacturer and sponsor by season from the club's kit history. Players shown for a season are the most-used from the season squad records (1993–94 onwards) or the trophy-season write-ups.":"Trøjebilleder fra sidens eget arkiv. Producent og sponsor pr. sæson fra klubbens trøjehistorik. De spillere, der vises for en sæson, er de mest brugte ifølge sæsonens trupdata (fra 1993–94) eller beskrivelserne af sæsoner med trofæer.","List of managers from Wikipedia, CC BY-SA 4.0. Records are competitive matches only (league, FA Cup, League Cup, Europe and other cups); wartime and pre-League games are not in the archive, which is why Albut, Busby and others fall short of the published totals shown in grey.":"Liste over managere fra Wikipedia, CC BY-SA 4.0. Statistikken omfatter kun officielle kampe (liga, FA Cup, Liga Cup, Europa og andre pokalturneringer); krigstidskampe og kampe før ligaen er ikke i arkivet, og derfor ligger Albut, Busby og andre under de officielle tal, der vises med gråt.","Liverpool John Lennon Airport: shuttle bus to Liverpool South Parkway, then Merseyrail Northern Line to Sandhills and the Soccerbus, or a taxi of 20-30 minutes depending on traffic. From Manchester Airport, take a direct train or coach to Liverpool city centre then bus or rail to Anfield.":"Liverpool John Lennon Airport: shuttlebus til Liverpool South Parkway, så Merseyrail Northern Line til Sandhills og Soccerbus, eller en taxa på 20-30 minutter afhængigt af trafikken. Fra Manchester Airport tager du et direkte tog eller en bus til Liverpool centrum og derefter bus eller tog til Anfield.","Mark shirts you own and ones you want from any shirt's page. A collection key (any phrase you'll remember, 6+ characters) saves it to this site privately so it follows you between devices; without one it stays in this browser only.":"Markér trøjer, du ejer, og dem du ønsker dig, fra enhver trøjes side. En samlingsnøgle (en vilkårlig sætning, du kan huske, 6+ tegn) gemmer den privat på siden, så den følger dig mellem enheder; uden en bliver den kun i denne browser.","Matches from the club archive (league, FA Cup, League Cup, Europe, Shields; friendlies and wartime leagues not included). Scorers from the season articles and, from 2025/26, the live feed; comeback tags from 2010 onwards. Weather, the kind of goal (volley, header) and who assisted are not recorded, so those words are ignored.":"Kampe fra klubarkivet (liga, FA Cup, Liga Cup, Europa, Shields; venskabskampe og krigstidsligaer er ikke med). Målscorere fra sæsonartiklerne og, fra 2025/26, live-feedet; comeback-mærker fra 2010 og frem. Vejr, måltype (volley, hovedstød) og hvem der lagde op registreres ikke, så de ord ignoreres.","Mello Mello Bar (677 Christchurch Road, Boscombe) is on the walking route from Pokesdown and welcomes visiting fans; Football Ground Guide also lists the Bell Inn (915 Christchurch Road, Pokesdown) and The George Tapps (Old Christchurch Road, town centre). The 1910 Supporters Bar and Queens Park Hotel are home-only.":"Mello Mello Bar (677 Christchurch Road, Boscombe) ligger på gåruten fra Pokesdown og byder udebanefans velkommen; Football Ground Guide nævner også Bell Inn (915 Christchurch Road, Pokesdown) og The George Tapps (Old Christchurch Road, bymidten). 1910 Supporters Bar og Queens Park Hotel er kun for hjemmefans.","Metrolink tram from the city centre (Piccadilly, Victoria, Market Street, St Peter's Square or Piccadilly Gardens) to the Etihad Campus stop takes 10-15 minutes (about 8 minutes from Piccadilly), every six minutes Monday to Saturday; Etihad Campus is in Zone 2, contactless tap-in accepted. The club says the walk from the city centre is roughly 30 minutes along the signposted Citylink walking route from Piccadilly through Ancoats, New Islington and Holt Town (20-25 minutes via Great Ancoats Street, Pollard Street and Ashton New Road). Ashburys rail station is five minutes by train from Piccadilly then about a 20-minute walk. TfGM runs matchday bus routes from across Greater Manchester.":"Metrolink-sporvognen fra centrum (Piccadilly, Victoria, Market Street, St Peter's Square eller Piccadilly Gardens) til stoppestedet Etihad Campus tager 10-15 minutter (cirka 8 minutter fra Piccadilly) og kører hvert sjette minut mandag til lørdag; Etihad Campus ligger i Zone 2, og kontaktløs betaling accepteres. Klubben siger, at gåturen fra centrum er cirka 30 minutter ad den skiltede Citylink-gårute fra Piccadilly gennem Ancoats, New Islington og Holt Town (20-25 minutter via Great Ancoats Street, Pollard Street og Ashton New Road). Ashburys-togstationen ligger fem minutter med tog fra Piccadilly og derefter cirka 20 minutters gang. TfGM kører busruter på kampdage fra hele Greater Manchester.","Most pubs near the stadium are home-only with doormen. Football Ground Guide names the Antwerp Arms (Church Road, mixed home and away) and the brewery taprooms on the Compass Industrial Estate (Tottenham Brewing Co, Tariff Road; One Mile End, Redemption and Bohem on West Road), 5 to 10 minutes from the away turnstiles, and suggests drinking in central London, e.g. the Hamilton Hall Wetherspoon at Liverpool Street.":"De fleste pubber nær stadion er kun for hjemmefans med dørmænd. Football Ground Guide nævner Antwerp Arms (Church Road, blandet hjemme og ude) og bryggeriernes taprooms på Compass Industrial Estate (Tottenham Brewing Co, Tariff Road; One Mile End, Redemption og Bohem på West Road), 5 til 10 minutter fra udebanens tælleapparater, og foreslår at drikke i det centrale London, f.eks. Hamilton Hall Wetherspoon ved Liverpool Street.","Newcastle Central Station is a ten-minute walk: head west along Neville Street then turn right onto St James' Boulevard and the stadium is at the top. Monument Metro station is a five-minute walk and St James Metro station is right by the ground. Haymarket and Eldon Square bus stations are on Percy Street, five minutes away; the nearest taxi rank is two minutes away opposite the Chinatown entrance, with major ranks at Central Station. There is no public parking at the stadium; a Park and Ride (X50, £2 return) runs from the Metrocentre and drops off on Barrack Road.":"Newcastle Central Station ligger ti minutters gang væk: gå mod vest ad Neville Street, drej så til højre ad St James' Boulevard, og stadion ligger for enden. Monument Metro-stationen ligger fem minutters gang væk, og St James Metro-stationen ligger lige ved stadion. Busstationerne Haymarket og Eldon Square ligger på Percy Street, fem minutter væk; den nærmeste taxaholdeplads ligger to minutter væk over for indgangen til Chinatown, med store holdepladser ved Central Station. Der er ingen offentlig parkering ved stadion; en Park and Ride (X50, £2 retur) kører fra Metrocentre og sætter af på Barrack Road.","Newcastle International Airport has its own Metro station; the club guide says the Metro to the city centre (Haymarket, Monument or Central) takes about 25 minutes with trains up to every 12 minutes in daytime, and Monument is a five-minute walk from the ground.":"Newcastle International Airport har sin egen Metro-station; klubbens guide siger, at Metroen til centrum (Haymarket, Monument eller Central) tager cirka 25 minutter med tog op til hvert 12. minut i dagtimerne, og Monument ligger fem minutters gang fra stadion.","No bags larger than A4 (21cm x 29.7cm); all fans and bags are searched, with pyro and drug dogs. A bag drop for larger bags, suitcases and motorcycle helmets operates outside the South East / Village Way entrance - the fee is quoted variously as £5 (Jan 2026) and £7.50 (Mar 2026), and one Oct 2025 guide said there was no bag storage, so check before travelling. Flags need pre-approval from the South Stand Manager and a fire safety certificate.":"Ingen tasker større end A4 (21cm x 29.7cm); alle fans og tasker visiteres, med pyro- og narkohunde. Et taskedepot for større tasker, kufferter og motorcykelhjelme findes uden for South East / Village Way-indgangen - prisen angives forskelligt som £5 (jan. 2026) og £7.50 (mar. 2026), og en guide fra okt. 2025 skrev, at der ikke var nogen taskeopbevaring, så tjek før du rejser. Flag kræver forhåndsgodkendelse fra South Stand Manager og et brandsikkerhedscertifikat.","No bags larger than A4 are permitted and there are no facilities to leave bags at the stadium (Football Ground Guide quotes a maximum of 30 x 20 x 10 cm and mentions an external paid storage option in Alderman Park). Musical instruments and selfie sticks are banned in the away end; flags need a fire certificate.":"Ingen tasker større end A4 er tilladt, og der er ingen mulighed for at efterlade tasker på stadion (Football Ground Guide angiver højst 30 x 20 x 10 cm og nævner en ekstern betalingsopbevaring i Alderman Park). Musikinstrumenter og selfiestænger er forbudt i udebaneafsnittet; flag kræver brandcertifikat.","No formal size limit is published. Spanish law (Law 19/2007, cited by the club) bans weapons, flares, fireworks, flammable or smoke-producing items and offensive banners; 2021 advice to United fans also barred alcohol, cans, glass, bottle tops and containers over 0.5 litres. No bag storage is mentioned at the ground.":"Der er ikke offentliggjort nogen formel størrelsesgrænse. Spansk lov (lov 19/2007, som klubben henviser til) forbyder våben, nødblus, fyrværkeri, brandfarlige eller røgudviklende genstande og stødende bannere; råd til United-fans i 2021 forbød også alkohol, dåser, glas, flaskekapsler og beholdere over 0.5 liter. Taskeopbevaring ved stadion nævnes ikke.","No league football 1915–19 and 1939–46 (wartime regional competitions are not counted). FA Cup rounds from the match records to 2018/19 and from the live feed after that. League tables are computed from every result with the points rules of the day.":"Ingen ligafodbold 1915–19 og 1939–46 (regionale krigstidsturneringer tæller ikke). FA Cup-runder fra kampdataene til 2018/19 og fra live-feedet derefter. Ligastillinger er beregnet ud fra alle resultater med datidens pointregler.","No pubs near the Amex are open to away fans - the Falmer pub is home-only and checks tickets. Away fans generally drink around Brighton station or in central Brighton (Yates and Wetherspoons are the usual suggestions) or in Lewes; there is a small fan zone with mobile bars outside the north-east corner and the North Stand bar is open to both sets of fans after the match.":"Ingen pubber nær Amex er åbne for udebanefans - Falmer-pubben er kun for hjemmefans og tjekker billetter. Udebanefans drikker generelt omkring Brighton-stationen eller i det centrale Brighton (Yates og Wetherspoons er de sædvanlige forslag) eller i Lewes; der er en lille fanzone med mobile barer uden for det nordøstlige hjørne, og baren i North Stand er åben for begge holds fans efter kampen.","Nottingham railway station is roughly a 20-minute walk (about 1.4 miles) or a 10-minute bus ride from the City Ground; from the city centre it is a brisk 15-20 minute walk - follow signs for Trent Bridge Cricket Ground, over the River Trent. Nottingham City Transport buses 5-11 drop closest to the ground but are heavily congested on matchdays. The nearest tram stop is Meadows Embankment, then a 20-minute walk. Taxi ranks are on Station Street and Queens Road at the front and rear of the station, or use Uber or Bolt.":"Nottingham-togstationen ligger cirka 20 minutters gang (cirka 1.4 miles) eller 10 minutter med bus fra City Ground; fra centrum er det 15-20 minutters rask gang - følg skiltene mod Trent Bridge Cricket Ground, over floden Trent. Nottingham City Transports bus 5-11 sætter af tættest på stadion, men er meget overfyldt på kampdage. Det nærmeste sporvognsstop er Meadows Embankment og derefter 20 minutters gang. Taxaholdepladserne ligger på Station Street og Queens Road foran og bag stationen, eller brug Uber eller Bolt.","Only bags A4 size or smaller are allowed; large bags and suitcases are not permitted and all bags are searched and tagged, which slows entry. Arsenal points to luggage storage at London King's Cross station rather than offering any at the ground; flags and banners in the away end must be fire certificated.":"Kun tasker i A4-størrelse eller mindre er tilladt; store tasker og kufferter er ikke tilladt, og alle tasker visiteres og mærkes, hvilket gør indgangen langsommere. Arsenal henviser til bagageopbevaring på London King's Cross-stationen i stedet for at tilbyde det på stadion; flag og bannere i udebaneafsnittet skal være brandcertificerede.","Only bags no larger than A4 (maximum 30cm x 20cm x 10cm) are allowed and all are searched; the club provides no bag storage but points to an independent matchday bag drop at Fulham Broadway Shopping Centre. Prohibited items include prams, large-lens cameras, glass, cans, plastic bottles over 500ml, aerosols, flag poles, umbrellas, selfie sticks, air horns and musical instruments; no smoking or vaping.":"Kun tasker, der ikke er større end A4 (højst 30cm x 20cm x 10cm), er tilladt, og alle visiteres; klubben tilbyder ingen taskeopbevaring, men henviser til et uafhængigt taskedepot på kampdage i Fulham Broadway Shopping Centre. Forbudte genstande omfatter barnevogne, kameraer med store objektiver, glas, dåser, plastflasker over 500ml, spraydåser, flagstænger, paraplyer, selfiestænger, trykluftshorn og musikinstrumenter; ingen rygning eller vaping.","Only small bags smaller than A4 (21cm x 29.7cm) are allowed; no large bags, suitcases, laptop bags or rucksacks, and Forest state they have nowhere to hold large bags and there is no bag drop. Clear plastic bottles up to 500ml, small compact cameras and small fold-up umbrellas are allowed; banned items include alcohol, cans and glass, food, face coverings, drones, poles and selfie sticks, musical instruments and video recording equipment. Banners need prior permission from Stadium Operations (0115 982 4444).":"Kun små tasker mindre end A4 (21cm x 29.7cm) er tilladt; ingen store tasker, kufferter, computertasker eller rygsække, og Forest oplyser, at de ikke har noget sted at opbevare store tasker, og at der ikke er noget taskedepot. Klare plastflasker op til 500ml, små kompaktkameraer og små sammenklappelige paraplyer er tilladt; forbudte genstande omfatter alkohol, dåser og glas, mad, ansigtstildækning, droner, stænger og selfiestænger, musikinstrumenter og videooptageudstyr. Bannere kræver forhåndstilladelse fra Stadium Operations (0115 982 4444).","Only small bags smaller than A4 are allowed; banned items include alcohol and canned drinks, glass and plastic bottles, sports bottles and flasks, laptops and tablets, large cameras, large umbrellas, poles, air horns, musical instruments, fireworks, flares and buggies. There is no left-luggage facility; for selected fixtures an advanced search bans coins, vapes, power banks and umbrellas, with a steward collection-ticket scheme for vapes, power banks and umbrellas only.":"Kun små tasker mindre end A4 er tilladt; forbudte genstande omfatter alkohol og dåsedrikke, glas- og plastflasker, sportsflasker og termokander, bærbare og tablets, store kameraer, store paraplyer, stænger, trykluftshorn, musikinstrumenter, fyrværkeri, nødblus og klapvogne. Der er ingen bagageopbevaring; ved udvalgte kampe forbyder en skærpet visitation mønter, vapes, powerbanks og paraplyer, med en ordning med afhentningsbillet hos stewarderne kun for vapes, powerbanks og paraplyer.","Only small handheld bags no larger than A4 (12 x 8 x 3 inches) are accepted; backpacks, holdalls and rucksacks are refused regardless of size, and pyrotechnics and smoke bombs are banned. There are no lockers, but a bag drop operates in the Grey car park inside the away compound at £10 per item.":"Kun små håndtasker, der ikke er større end A4 (12 x 8 x 3 inches), accepteres; rygsække og rejsetasker afvises uanset størrelse, og pyroteknik og røgbomber er forbudt. Der er ingen opbevaringsskabe, men et taskedepot findes på Grey car park inden for udebaneområdet til £10 pr. genstand.","Only small handheld bags no larger than A5 (148.5 x 210mm) are allowed and all bags get a visual search; larger bags are only permitted for medication or medical equipment with prior approval via disability@liverpoolfc.com at least 48 hours before the game. Banned items include cans, flasks, glass, plastic bottles over 500ml, laptops or tablets, drones, selfie sticks, flares, tools, weapons, laser devices, musical instruments and loud hailers; no bag storage is offered by the club.":"Kun små håndtasker, ikke større end A5 (148.5 x 210mm), er tilladt, og alle tasker bliver visuelt tjekket; større tasker er kun tilladt til medicin eller medicinsk udstyr efter forhåndsgodkendelse via disability@liverpoolfc.com mindst 48 timer før kampen. Forbudte genstande omfatter dåser, termokander, glas, plastflasker over 500ml, bærbare eller tablets, droner, selfiestænger, nødblus, værktøj, våben, laserudstyr, musikinstrumenter og megafoner; klubben tilbyder ingen taskeopbevaring.","Pick a fixture and a shape. The whole first-team squad is offered (players out on loan are not listed); anyone injured, suspended or doubtful is marked in the list and sorted to the bottom. Each player can be used once. Your XI is saved in this browser per fixture.":"Vælg en kamp og en formation. Hele førsteholdstruppen er med (udlejede spillere er ikke på listen); skadede, karantæneramte eller tvivlsomme er markeret og sorteret nederst. Hver spiller kan bruges én gang. Din startellever gemmes i denne browser for hver kamp.","Players, seasons, opponents, managers, records, this season. The answer is written by Claude from the data on this site only — the archive built from Wikipedia's season tables and squad lists, plus the live feed — and it links the pages it used. If the site doesn't hold it, it says so.":"Spillere, sæsoner, modstandere, managere, rekorder, denne sæson. Svaret skrives af Claude kun ud fra data på denne side — arkivet bygget på Wikipedias sæsontabeller og truplister samt live-feedet — og det linker til de sider, det har brugt. Hvis siden ikke har det, siger det det.","Pokesdown for Boscombe is the nearest station, about a 15-minute walk (turn right onto Christchurch Road, then right into Gloucester Road); Pokesdown is not currently wheelchair accessible. Bournemouth (Central) station is a 25 to 30-minute walk: leave by the south exit, turn left to Holdenhurst Road, follow it to the Queens Park roundabout and turn right into Kings Park Drive. Yellow Buses No. 33 runs from outside Bournemouth station south exit (ask for Kings Park Drive), or take a taxi from either station. The club discourages driving: from 2026/27 there is no general admission parking in the Kings Park car parks and the council enforces local restrictions on matchdays.":"Pokesdown for Boscombe er den nærmeste station, cirka 15 minutters gang (drej til højre ad Christchurch Road og så til højre ad Gloucester Road); Pokesdown er i øjeblikket ikke kørestolsvenlig. Bournemouth (Central)-stationen ligger 25 til 30 minutters gang væk: gå ud ad den sydlige udgang, drej til venstre mod Holdenhurst Road, følg den til rundkørslen ved Queens Park og drej til højre ad Kings Park Drive. Yellow Buses nr. 33 kører fra Bournemouth-stationens sydlige udgang (spørg efter Kings Park Drive), eller tag en taxa fra en af stationerne. Klubben fraråder at køre i bil: fra 2026/27 er der ingen almindelig parkering på Kings Park-parkeringspladserne, og kommunen håndhæver lokale restriktioner på kampdage.","Post-match queuing systems run at all four stations; follow signage and stewards. Trains at Northumberland Park are split into northbound and southbound queues and the station gets very congested; some fans walk to Seven Sisters or Tottenham Hale for the Victoria line. Last train times: not stated; use the toilets inside the ground as there are none at the local stations.":"Der er køsystemer efter kampen på alle fire stationer; følg skiltningen og stewarderne. Togene ved Northumberland Park er delt i køer mod nord og mod syd, og stationen bliver meget overfyldt; nogle fans går til Seven Sisters eller Tottenham Hale for at tage Victoria-linjen. Sidste tog: ikke oplyst; brug toiletterne på stadion, da der ikke er nogen på de lokale stationer.","Premier League, Old Trafford. Bruce 86, 90+6; Hirst 65 (pen). Referee Michael Peck pulled a muscle and linesman John Hilditch took over, which is why seven minutes were added. 'Fergie time' was born here. A penalty down with the title slipping, then Bruce's header in the 86th and another seven minutes into stoppage time — Ferguson and Kidd on the pitch, and the first title in 26 years within reach.":"Premier League, Old Trafford. Bruce 86, 90+6; Hirst 65 (str.). Dommer Michael Peck fik en muskelskade, og linjedommer John Hilditch tog over, og derfor blev der lagt syv minutter til. 'Fergie time' blev født her. Et straffespark bagud med titlen ved at glide væk, så Bruces hovedstød i det 86. minut og endnu et syv minutter inde i overtiden — Ferguson og Kidd ude på banen, og det første mesterskab i 26 år inden for rækkevidde.","Premier League, Old Trafford. Keane 36, G. Neville 42, Solskjær 68; Juninho 15, Emerson 50, Hignett 61 (pen). The point that left Liverpool needing to win at Wimbledon the next night. They lost, Newcastle drew, and the title was United's.":"Premier League, Old Trafford. Keane 36, G. Neville 42, Solskjær 68; Juninho 15, Emerson 50, Hignett 61 (str.). Pointet, der betød, at Liverpool skulle vinde mod Wimbledon den næste aften. De tabte, Newcastle spillede uafgjort, og mesterskabet var Uniteds.","Profile and list of managers from Wikipedia, CC BY-SA 4.0. Records are computed from the match archive (league and FA Cup), the Wikipedia season articles (League Cup, Europe and other cups from 1956/57) and the live feed; wartime and pre-League games are not included, which is why some totals fall short of the published figure.":"Profil og liste over managere fra Wikipedia, CC BY-SA 4.0. Statistikken er beregnet ud fra kamparkivet (liga og FA Cup), Wikipedias sæsonartikler (Liga Cup, Europa og andre pokalturneringer fra 1956/57) og live-feedet; krigstidskampe og kampe før ligaen er ikke med, og derfor ligger nogle totaler under de officielle tal.","Pubs around the ground generally welcome both home and away fans. Brentford name The Gunnersbury and The Pilot near Gunnersbury station, Express Tavern, One Over the Ait, The Bell & Crown, The Steam Packet and City Barge closest to the stadium, and The Rose and Crown, The Greyhound, The Coach & Horses and The Botanist on Kew Green. Fulham Supporters Trust (Apr 2026) describe The Gunnersbury (590 Chiswick High Road) as the designated away pub and suggest booking.":"Pubberne omkring stadion byder generelt både hjemme- og udebanefans velkommen. Brentford nævner The Gunnersbury og The Pilot nær Gunnersbury-stationen, Express Tavern, One Over the Ait, The Bell & Crown, The Steam Packet og City Barge tættest på stadion samt The Rose and Crown, The Greyhound, The Coach & Horses og The Botanist på Kew Green. Fulham Supporters Trust (apr. 2026) beskriver The Gunnersbury (590 Chiswick High Road) som den udpegede udebanepub og foreslår at reservere.","Retained with eight points to spare, and the first English side to enter the European Cup against the League's wishes — Anderlecht were beaten 10–0 at Maine Road in September and Real Madrid ended the run in the semi-final. The Double was lost only at Wembley, where goalkeeper Ray Wood's cheekbone was broken after six minutes against Aston Villa and Jackie Blanchflower went in goal.":"Forsvaret med otte point ned til nr. 2, og det første engelske hold, der deltog i Mesterholdenes Europa Cup, mod ligaens ønske — Anderlecht blev slået 10–0 på Maine Road i september, og Real Madrid stoppede eventyret i semifinalen. The Double blev først tabt på Wembley, hvor målmand Ray Woods kindben blev brækket efter seks minutter mod Aston Villa, og Jackie Blanchflower gik i mål.","Roads around the stadium close from three hours before kick-off until about one hour after the final whistle, and the ground is residential so keep noise down when leaving. Return via Norwood Junction (London Bridge), Selhurst (Victoria) or Thornton Heath (London Bridge or Clapham Junction); expect plenty of trains to London Bridge but a long wait for Clapham Junction services and a cramped away concourse. Last trains to Manchester: not stated; the N68 night bus serves evening matches.":"Vejene omkring stadion lukker fra tre timer før kampstart til cirka en time efter slutfløjtet, og området er et boligkvarter, så skru ned for støjen, når du går. Tag hjem via Norwood Junction (London Bridge), Selhurst (Victoria) eller Thornton Heath (London Bridge eller Clapham Junction); regn med masser af tog til London Bridge, men lang ventetid på tog til Clapham Junction og en trang udebanefoyer. Sidste tog til Manchester: ikke oplyst; natbussen N68 kører efter aftenkampe.","Ronaldo's 42 goals, the Ballon d'Or, and the Double of league and European Cup, fifty years after Munich. Tevez and Nani and Anderson arrived; the title was won at Wigan on the last day while Chelsea drew with Bolton. The final in Moscow, against Chelsea, was 1–1 after Ronaldo's header and Lampard's equaliser, and went to penalties: Ronaldo missed, John Terry slipped with the cup on his boot, and Van der Sar saved from Anelka.":"Ronaldos 42 mål, Ballon d'Or og The Double med liga og Mesterholdenes Europa Cup, halvtreds år efter München. Tevez, Nani og Anderson kom; mesterskabet blev vundet i Wigan i sidste spillerunde, mens Chelsea spillede uafgjort mod Bolton. Finalen i Moskva mod Chelsea stod 1–1 efter Ronaldos hovedstød og Lampards udligning og gik til straffesparkskonkurrence: Ronaldo brændte, John Terry gled med pokalen for foden, og Van der Sar reddede fra Anelka.","Rooney's best season as a United player, 34 goals and both player-of-the-year awards, and the League Cup retained against Aston Villa with a late Rooney header from the bench. The title was lost by a point to Chelsea — the 2–1 defeat at Stamford Bridge in April, with Drogba's offside winner, was the hinge — and Bayern went through on away goals in the European quarter-final after Rafael's red card.":"Rooneys bedste sæson i United, 34 mål og begge kåringer som årets spiller, og Liga Cup'en forsvaret mod Aston Villa med et sent Rooney-hovedstød fra bænken. Mesterskabet blev tabt med ét point til Chelsea — 1–2-nederlaget på Stamford Bridge i april, med Drogbas offside-sejrsmål, var omdrejningspunktet — og Bayern gik videre på udebanemål i den europæiske kvartfinale efter Rafaels røde kort.","Rossio Square and the surrounding streets in the centre are the usual base for away fans. Football Ground Guide lists bars such as The Red Frog Speakeasy, Artis Bar and Clube da Esquina, and sports bars The Couch, Alta Spot and Mignon; none are specifically away-fan pubs.":"Rossio-pladsen og gaderne omkring i centrum er det sædvanlige samlingssted for udebanefans. Football Ground Guide nævner barer som The Red Frog Speakeasy, Artis Bar og Clube da Esquina samt sportsbarerne The Couch, Alta Spot og Mignon; ingen af dem er decideret udebanefan-pubber.","Selhurst Park is cashless (Apple Pay and Google Pay accepted). Visiting tickets are collected at Entrance 4; the Box Office closes two hours before kick-off. Views from the very back of the Arthur Wait Stand are poor, so arrive early; the concourse sells burgers, pies, chips and alcohol before kick-off and at half-time.":"Selhurst Park er kontantfri (Apple Pay og Google Pay accepteres). Udebanebilletter afhentes ved Indgang 4; billetkontoret lukker to timer før kampstart. Udsigten fra de bageste rækker i Arthur Wait Stand er dårlig, så kom tidligt; foyeren sælger burgere, tærter, pommes frites og alkohol før kampstart og i pausen.","Selhurst, Thornton Heath and Norwood Junction stations are each about a 15-minute walk from the ground; do not use Crystal Palace station, which is two miles away. The club gives total journey times of about 40 minutes from Victoria (Southern to Selhurst), 30 minutes from London Bridge (Southern to Norwood Junction), 45 minutes from Waterloo via Clapham Junction, and 50 minutes from Euston or King's Cross via the Northern line to London Bridge. Taxis should drop off at the corner of Park Road and Whitehorse Lane at the visiting supporter end; there is no parking at the stadium and surrounding streets are permit holders only.":"Selhurst-, Thornton Heath- og Norwood Junction-stationerne ligger hver cirka 15 minutters gang fra stadion; brug ikke Crystal Palace-stationen, som ligger to miles væk. Klubben angiver samlede rejsetider på cirka 40 minutter fra Victoria (Southern til Selhurst), 30 minutter fra London Bridge (Southern til Norwood Junction), 45 minutter fra Waterloo via Clapham Junction og 50 minutter fra Euston eller King's Cross via Northern-linjen til London Bridge. Taxaer bør sætte af på hjørnet af Park Road og Whitehorse Lane ved udebaneenden; der er ingen parkering ved stadion, og gaderne omkring er kun for indehavere af tilladelse.","Squad from the club's first-team list (1 Sept 2026); portraits and bios from Wikipedia (Creative Commons); injuries, suspensions and season statistics from API-Football. United-career totals are being compiled and will appear next to the season figures.":"Truppen fra klubbens førsteholdsliste (1. sep. 2026); portrætter og biografier fra Wikipedia (Creative Commons); skader, karantæner og sæsonstatistik fra API-Football. Totaler for United-karrieren er ved at blive samlet og vil stå ved siden af sæsontallene.","Strawberry Place and Leazes Terrace close from two hours before kick-off until roughly 30-45 minutes after full time, and Barrack Road closes 10 minutes before full time for 20-45 minutes, so allow extra time. Central Station is a ten-minute walk and Monument Metro five minutes; the Metrocentre Park and Ride returns from St James' Boulevard with the last bus one hour after the final whistle. Last trains to Manchester or London: not stated.":"Strawberry Place og Leazes Terrace lukker fra to timer før kampstart til cirka 30-45 minutter efter slutfløjtet, og Barrack Road lukker 10 minutter før slutfløjtet i 20-45 minutter, så beregn ekstra tid. Central Station ligger ti minutters gang væk og Monument Metro fem minutter; Park and Ride fra Metrocentre kører tilbage fra St James' Boulevard med sidste bus en time efter slutfløjtet. Sidste tog til Manchester eller London: ikke oplyst.","Sunderland railway station is the nearest main-line station, 10-15 minutes' walk from the ground (just under a mile, north along the riverbank). The Tyne and Wear Metro serves the ground via two stops: St Peter's (3 minutes' walk) and Stadium of Light (10 minutes' walk, deceptively named). Buses E2, 2, 3, 4, 9, 12, 13, 15, 16, 23, 24 and 56 stop nearby and Park Lane Interchange bus station is within walking distance; a free Park and Ride runs from Sunderland Enterprise Park off the A1231 every five minutes for 90 minutes before kick-off. Taxi drop-off is outside the Black Cat House store any time before kick-off.":"Sunderland-togstationen er den nærmeste hovedbanestation, 10-15 minutters gang fra stadion (knap en mile, mod nord langs flodbredden). Tyne and Wear Metro betjener stadion via to stop: St Peter's (3 minutters gang) og Stadium of Light (10 minutters gang, misvisende navn). Bus E2, 2, 3, 4, 9, 12, 13, 15, 16, 23, 24 og 56 stopper i nærheden, og Park Lane Interchange-busstationen ligger inden for gåafstand; en gratis Park and Ride kører fra Sunderland Enterprise Park ved A1231 hvert femte minut i 90 minutter før kampstart. Taxaer kan sætte af uden for Black Cat House-butikken når som helst før kampstart.","Ten years and three months after Munich, the European Cup. Hibernians of Malta, Sarajevo and Górnik Zabrze were beaten, then Real Madrid in the semi-final: 1–0 at Old Trafford, 3–1 down in the Bernabéu at half-time, then Sadler and Bill Foulkes — Munich survivor, centre-half — scored to go through 4–3. The final at Wembley was 1–1 after 90 minutes against Benfica and Eusébio; United scored three in the first eight minutes of extra time. Best won the Ballon d'Or; Busby was knighted.":"Ti år og tre måneder efter München, Mesterholdenes Europa Cup. Hibernians fra Malta, Sarajevo og Górnik Zabrze blev slået, derefter Real Madrid i semifinalen: 1–0 på Old Trafford, bagud 1–3 på Bernabéu ved pausen, og så scorede Sadler og Bill Foulkes — München-overlevende, midterforsvarer — så United gik videre 4–3. Finalen på Wembley stod 1–1 efter 90 minutter mod Benfica og Eusébio; United scorede tre i de første otte minutter af den forlængede spilletid. Best vandt Ballon d'Or; Busby blev adlet.","The 12th FA Cup, 12 years after the 11th, and Van Gaal's only trophy — he was sacked two days after the final. Martial, 19, scored the stoppage-time winner against Everton in the semi-final; Marcus Rashford, 18, had burst in with two goals on his debut against Midtjylland in February and two more against Arsenal three days later. The final against Crystal Palace went to extra time after Puncheon's goal and Mata's reply; Lingard volleyed the winner with ten men after Smalling's red card.":"Den 12. FA Cup-titel, 12 år efter den 11., og Van Gaals eneste trofæ — han blev fyret to dage efter finalen. Martial, 19, scorede sejrsmålet i overtiden mod Everton i semifinalen; Marcus Rashford, 18, var brudt igennem med to mål i sin debut mod FC Midtjylland i februar og to mere mod Arsenal tre dage senere. Finalen mod Crystal Palace gik i forlænget spilletid efter Puncheons mål og Matas svar; Lingard sendte sejrsmålet ind på volley med ti mand efter Smallings røde kort.","The 19th title, the one that passed Liverpool. Unbeaten at home all season, won only five away before February, and still champions by nine points; Chicharito, £7m from Guadalajara, scored 20; Berbatov shared the Golden Boot. Rooney's overhead kick beat City in February; the title was clinched at Blackburn with his penalty on 14 May. The season ended with Barcelona at Wembley — a 3–1 defeat Ferguson called the best side he had faced.":"Det 19. mesterskab, det der passerede Liverpool. Ubesejret hjemme hele sæsonen, kun fem udesejre før februar, og alligevel mestre med ni point; Chicharito, £7m fra Guadalajara, scorede 20; Berbatov delte Den Gyldne Støvle. Rooneys saksespark slog City i februar; mesterskabet blev sikret i Blackburn med hans straffespark den 14. maj. Sæsonen sluttede med Barcelona på Wembley — et 1–3-nederlag til det, Ferguson kaldte det bedste hold, han havde mødt.","The 25 second-tier seasons (the last 1974-75) are left out of the rankings and quick picks unless you include them; divisions differ in strength and size. League games only: cup ties carry no points, and the archive holds every league game but not every cup tie, so there is no all-competitions view.":"De 25 sæsoner i næstbedste række (den sidste 1974-75) er udeladt af ranglister og hurtigvalg, medmindre du medtager dem; divisionerne er forskellige i styrke og størrelse. Kun ligakampe: pokalkampe giver ingen point, og arkivet har alle ligakampe, men ikke alle pokalkampe, så der er ingen visning for alle turneringer.","The 927 bus departs St Domingo Road (by the Valley Sports Bar) for 2.5 hours after the match, the 917 returns from Walton Lane, and the Soccerbus to Sandhills runs for 90 minutes after full-time. Expect long queues for the Soccerbus and busy bus stops, with Walton Breck Road closed to traffic as the crowd leaves; coaches leaving turn left. Last trains to Manchester: not stated.":"927-bussen kører fra St Domingo Road (ved Valley Sports Bar) i 2.5 timer efter kampen, 917 kører tilbage fra Walton Lane, og Soccerbus til Sandhills kører i 90 minutter efter slutfløjtet. Regn med lange køer til Soccerbus og fyldte busstoppesteder, og Walton Breck Road er lukket for trafik, mens publikum forlader stadion; busser, der kører, drejer til venstre. Sidste tog til Manchester: ikke oplyst.","The Amex is fully cashless. Arrive early - the concourse opens 2 hours before kick-off and visiting fans are advised to arrive at least an hour before. Do not park on streets near the ground (residents' scheme, heavy ticketing); Park & Ride at Mill Road (fills about 1.5 hours before kick-off) or Brighton Racecourse must be pre-booked. Report anti-social behaviour by text to 07880 196442.":"Amex er helt kontantfri. Kom tidligt - foyeren åbner 2 timer før kampstart, og udebanefans rådes til at ankomme mindst en time før. Parkér ikke på gaderne nær stadion (beboerordning, mange bøder); Park & Ride ved Mill Road (fyldt cirka 1.5 timer før kampstart) eller Brighton Racecourse skal forudbestilles. Anmeld chikanøs adfærd via sms til 07880 196442.","The Busby Babes' first title, won with the youngest side the division had seen — average age 22 — by an eleven-point margin that stood as a record for decades. Duncan Edwards was 19, Eddie Colman 19, Byrne the senior man at 26. The championship was clinched with two games to spare against Blackpool, the only side still in range.":"Busby Babes' første mesterskab, vundet med det yngste hold, divisionen havde set — gennemsnitsalder 22 — og med en margin på elleve point, der var rekord i årtier. Duncan Edwards var 19, Eddie Colman 19, Byrne den ældste med 26. Mesterskabet blev sikret med to kampe tilbage mod Blackpool, det eneste hold, der stadig var inden for rækkevidde.","The City Ground is cashless (card payments only). All tickets are digital for 2026/27 - have your phone charged with brightness up and the QR code ready; if there is a problem, the Visitors' Ticket Office Collection Point next to the away turnstiles opens 90 minutes before kick-off (proof of booking and photo ID required) and closes at half-time. Parking at the ground is very limited; use the approved car parks at Meadow Lane, Cattlemarket, Lady Bay Sports Ground or County Hall and avoid West Bridgford residential streets. Under-14s must be with an adult. Report anti-social behaviour by texting FOREST to 80800.":"City Ground er kontantfri (kun kortbetaling). Alle billetter er digitale i 2026/27 - hav telefonen opladet med skærmlysstyrken skruet op og QR-koden klar; er der et problem, åbner Visitors' Ticket Office Collection Point ved siden af udebanens tælleapparater 90 minutter før kampstart (bevis for booking og billed-ID kræves) og lukker i pausen. Parkering ved stadion er meget begrænset; brug de godkendte parkeringspladser ved Meadow Lane, Cattlemarket, Lady Bay Sports Ground eller County Hall, og undgå boligvejene i West Bridgford. Børn under 14 skal være med en voksen. Anmeld chikanøs adfærd ved at sende FOREST til 80800.","The Glazer takeover summer, Keane's departure in November after the MUTV interview, out of the Champions League at the group stage for the first time in a decade — and a League Cup won 4–0 against Wigan in Cardiff, with Rooney scoring twice. Van Nistelrooy was left on the bench for the final and left for Madrid in the summer. Edwin van der Sar and Park Ji-sung arrived; the side that would win three straight titles was forming.":"Sommeren med Glazer-overtagelsen, Keanes exit i november efter MUTV-interviewet, ude af Champions League i gruppespillet for første gang i ti år — og en Liga Cup vundet 4–0 mod Wigan i Cardiff, med to mål af Rooney. Van Nistelrooy blev sat på bænken i finalen og skiftede til Madrid om sommeren. Edwin van der Sar og Park Ji-sung kom; holdet, der skulle vinde tre mesterskaber i træk, var ved at tage form.","The Nest (Iremonger Road, NG2 3HU, next to Notts County's Meadow Lane) is Nottingham's dedicated away-fan fanzone, about a 10-minute walk from the away turnstiles and on the direct walking route from the station, with capacity for over 1300, big screen, bars and street food; it opens only to away ticket holders on selected matchdays (free tickets may be required) - see nestnotts.co.uk. No pubs are named by the sources.":"The Nest (Iremonger Road, NG2 3HU, ved siden af Notts Countys Meadow Lane) er Nottinghams dedikerede fanzone for udebanefans, cirka 10 minutters gang fra udebanens tælleapparater og på den direkte gårute fra stationen, med plads til over 1300, storskærm, barer og streetfood; den åbner kun for indehavere af udebanebilletter på udvalgte kampdage (gratis billetter kan være påkrævet) - se nestnotts.co.uk. Kilderne nævner ingen pubber.","The Stadium of Light is cashless, card only; the away concourse has two food and drink courtyards open from turnstiles opening, at half time and for 30 minutes after full time. Strict no re-admission. Supporter Liaison Officer: chris.waters@safc.com; asksafc.com handles pre-match queries.":"Stadium of Light er kontantfri, kun kort; udebanefoyeren har to gårde med mad og drikke, der er åbne fra tælleapparaterne åbner, i pausen og i 30 minutter efter slutfløjtet. Ingen genindgang, uden undtagelse. Supporter Liaison Officer: chris.waters@safc.com; asksafc.com tager sig af spørgsmål før kampen.","The Treble. Thirty-three games unbeaten from Boxing Day to the end of May, every competition decided in the final ten days. The league was won on the last day against Tottenham after going a goal down; the FA Cup final against Newcastle was 2–0, four days after the semi-final replay against Arsenal that Schmeichel's penalty save and Giggs's run had turned; and in Barcelona on 26 May, trailing to Mario Basler's sixth-minute free-kick for 85 minutes, Sheringham and Solskjær scored from two Beckham corners in injury time. Keane's semi-final at Juventus — booked, knowing he would miss the final, and dragging United from 2–0 down to win 3–2 — is the performance Ferguson rated above any other.":"The Treble. 33 kampe uden nederlag fra 2. juledag til slutningen af maj, og alle turneringer afgjort inden for de sidste ti dage. Ligaen blev vundet i sidste spillerunde mod Tottenham efter at have været bagud med et mål; FA Cup-finalen mod Newcastle endte 2–0, fire dage efter semifinaleomkampen mod Arsenal, som Schmeichels straffesparksredning og Giggs' løb havde vendt; og i Barcelona den 26. maj, efter at have været bagud på Mario Baslers frispark fra sjette minut i 85 minutter, scorede Sheringham og Solskjær på to hjørnespark fra Beckham i overtiden. Keanes semifinale mod Juventus — advaret, vel vidende at han ville misse finalen, og han trak United fra 0–2 til en 3–2-sejr — er den præstation, Ferguson satte over alle andre.","The arena is about 4 miles north of Coventry railway station (15-20 minutes by road), so it is not walkable from town. The club-subsidised shuttle bus costs £5 return (contactless only, no one-way tickets), picking up at the rail replacement stop by Coventry station (near Central Six) and White Street Coach Park, from three hours before kick-off at half-hour intervals until one hour before, dropping at the bus station at Arena Park shopping centre. Coventry Arena station is on site but has no special matchday service and only takes short trains. By public bus: No. 9 from the station to the Transport Museum, then No. 3 from Trinity Street or No. 5 from Pool Meadow to Arena Park (Tesco) and through the underpass. A taxi from the centre is around £15.":"Arenaen ligger cirka 4 miles nord for Coventry-togstationen (15-20 minutter ad vej), så man kan ikke gå derud fra byen. Shuttlebussen, som klubben giver tilskud til, koster £5 retur (kun kontaktløs, ingen enkeltbilletter) og samler op ved togbusstoppet ved Coventry-stationen (nær Central Six) og White Street Coach Park, fra tre timer før kampstart med en halv times mellemrum indtil en time før, og sætter af ved busstationen ved Arena Park-indkøbscentret. Coventry Arena-stationen ligger på stedet, men har ingen særlige afgange på kampdage og kan kun tage korte tog. Med offentlig bus: nr. 9 fra stationen til Transport Museum, og så nr. 3 fra Trinity Street eller nr. 5 fra Pool Meadow til Arena Park (Tesco) og gennem tunnelen. En taxa fra centrum koster cirka £15.","The arena's prohibited items list bans large bags and suitcases but gives no size limit; also banned are glasses, bottles and cans, outside food and drink, cameras, computer tablets, long umbrellas, flagpoles, selfie sticks, air horns, fireworks and flares, baby buggies and prams, and flags over 2m x 1m. Bags may be searched on entry; no locker or left-luggage option is stated.":"Arenaens liste over forbudte genstande forbyder store tasker og kufferter, men angiver ingen størrelsesgrænse; også forbudt er glas, flasker og dåser, medbragt mad og drikke, kameraer, tablets, lange paraplyer, flagstænger, selfiestænger, trykluftshorn, fyrværkeri og nødblus, klapvogne og barnevogne samt flag over 2m x 1m. Tasker kan blive visiteret ved indgangen; der er ikke oplyst nogen opbevaringsskabe eller bagageopbevaring.","The club guide names no pubs. Football Ground Guide names The Arkles (77 Anfield Road) as the main pub for travelling fans a few minutes from the ground, plus The Flat Iron (Walton Breck Road) and The Thomas Frost Wetherspoons (Walton Road), and says many visiting fans drink in the city centre around Concert Square, Bold Street or Mathew Street before heading to the ground.":"Klubbens guide nævner ingen pubber. Football Ground Guide nævner The Arkles (77 Anfield Road) som den vigtigste pub for udebanefans, få minutter fra stadion, samt The Flat Iron (Walton Breck Road) og The Thomas Frost Wetherspoons (Walton Road), og skriver, at mange udebanefans drikker i centrum omkring Concert Square, Bold Street eller Mathew Street, før de tager til stadion.","The club names The Station Hotel opposite the railway station as the official away pub (garden, TV screens, Greene King beers); most pubs around the ground are home only and the Portman Road FanZone is home fans only. For those arriving via the A14 the club lists The Maltings in Stowmarket, the Sorrel Horse in Barham and the Live Lounge in Stowmarket as away-friendly. Football Ground Guide also names the Lord Nelson, Dove Street Inn and Isaacs on the Quay.":"Klubben nævner The Station Hotel over for togstationen som den officielle udebanepub (have, tv-skærme, Greene King-øl); de fleste pubber omkring stadion er kun for hjemmefans, og Portman Road FanZone er kun for hjemmefans. For dem, der kommer via A14, nævner klubben The Maltings i Stowmarket, Sorrel Horse i Barham og Live Lounge i Stowmarket som venlige over for udebanefans. Football Ground Guide nævner også Lord Nelson, Dove Street Inn og Isaacs on the Quay.","The club names no away pubs and says local pubs are used by home supporters; drinking in public areas is not allowed across Greater Manchester. Football Ground Guide says most away fans drink in the city centre and take the tram out, lists The Townley, Grove Inn and The Corner Shop as City pubs where colours should not be worn, says Mary D's should be avoided, and specifically tells Manchester United fans to use the city centre.":"Klubben nævner ingen udebanepubber og siger, at de lokale pubber bruges af hjemmefans; det er ikke tilladt at drikke på offentlige steder i hele Greater Manchester. Football Ground Guide siger, at de fleste udebanefans drikker i centrum og tager sporvognen derud, nævner The Townley, Grove Inn og The Corner Shop som City-pubber, hvor man ikke bør bære klubfarver, siger, at Mary D's bør undgås, og beder specifikt Manchester United-fans om at bruge centrum.","The club page names no pubs. Football Ground Guide names The Prince George (2 High Street, Thornton Heath) as the most popular, about a 10-minute walk, plus The Railway Telegraph (Brigstock Road, Thornton Heath), The Clifton Arms (Clifton Road, SE25) and The White Horse (Selhurst Road, SE25).":"Klubbens side nævner ingen pubber. Football Ground Guide nævner The Prince George (2 High Street, Thornton Heath) som den mest populære, cirka 10 minutters gang, plus The Railway Telegraph (Brigstock Road, Thornton Heath), The Clifton Arms (Clifton Road, SE25) og The White Horse (Selhurst Road, SE25).","The club recommends The Longford Engine, 270 Bedworth Road, CV6 6BP, a 17-minute walk from the arena. Football Ground Guide adds the Bull and Anchor (Wheelwright Lane, about 10 minutes), The Old Crown, Byatts Brewery and Dhillon's Brewery. Options around the ground are limited, so drinking in the city centre before travelling out is the usual choice.":"Klubben anbefaler The Longford Engine, 270 Bedworth Road, CV6 6BP, 17 minutters gang fra arenaen. Football Ground Guide tilføjer Bull and Anchor (Wheelwright Lane, cirka 10 minutter), The Old Crown, Byatts Brewery og Dhillon's Brewery. Mulighederne omkring stadion er begrænsede, så det sædvanlige valg er at drikke i centrum, før man tager derud.","The club says there is no designated away pub and some nearby venues may refuse visiting supporters, particularly in colours, but Shearer's Bar under the Gallowgate Stand is open to all supporters and The Gate and Chinatown are a short walk away. Football Ground Guide names The Head of Steam and The Newcastle Tap (Neville Street, by Central Station), Percy Arms (Percy Street), The Trent House (Leazes Lane), and says The Strawberry near the ground generally admits away fans.":"Klubben siger, at der ikke er nogen udpeget udebanepub, og at nogle steder i nærheden kan afvise udebanefans, især i klubfarver, men Shearer's Bar under Gallowgate Stand er åben for alle fans, og The Gate og Chinatown ligger kort gang væk. Football Ground Guide nævner The Head of Steam og The Newcastle Tap (Neville Street, ved Central Station), Percy Arms (Percy Street), The Trent House (Leazes Lane) og siger, at The Strawberry nær stadion generelt lukker udebanefans ind.","The club states none of the pubs around Stamford Bridge admit visiting fans and that the nearest away-friendly pubs are in Earl's Court, about 25 to 30 minutes' walk (1.4 miles). Football Ground Guide names The Courtfield Tavern (opposite Earl's Court station), The Goose (248 North End Road), The Blackbird and Earl's Court Tavern (Earls Court Road).":"Klubben oplyser, at ingen af pubberne omkring Stamford Bridge lukker udebanefans ind, og at de nærmeste pubber for udebanefans ligger i Earl's Court, cirka 25 til 30 minutters gang (1.4 miles). Football Ground Guide nævner The Courtfield Tavern (over for Earl's Court-stationen), The Goose (248 North End Road), The Blackbird og Earl's Court Tavern (Earls Court Road).","The club strongly advises against bringing a bag; if you must, it has to be a clear carrier bag up to 30cm x 30cm or a personal bag no larger than A4 (21cm x 30cm); laptop sleeves up to 37cm x 31cm. Expect longer queues with a bag and airport-style searches. No bag drop or storage is provided.":"Klubben fraråder kraftigt at tage en taske med; skal du, skal det være en gennemsigtig bærepose op til 30cm x 30cm eller en personlig taske, der ikke er større end A4 (21cm x 30cm); computerposer op til 37cm x 31cm. Regn med længere køer med taske og visitation som i en lufthavn. Der er intet taskedepot eller opbevaring.","The club's first league title, six years after the Newton Heath rescue and still playing at Bank Street, Clayton. Mangnall's side had been assembled cheaply from the Manchester City players banned over illegal payments — Billy Meredith, Sandy Turnbull, Herbert Burgess and Jimmy Bannister — and ran away with the championship by nine points. Turnbull's 25 goals were the division's most.":"Klubbens første mesterskab, seks år efter redningen af Newton Heath og stadig med hjemmebane på Bank Street i Clayton. Mangnalls hold var samlet billigt fra de Manchester City-spillere, der var blevet udelukket for ulovlige betalinger — Billy Meredith, Sandy Turnbull, Herbert Burgess og Jimmy Bannister — og vandt mesterskabet suverænt med ni point. Turnbulls 25 mål var flest i divisionen.","The club's guide directs visiting fans to pubs around Keel Square and High Street West in the city centre (then over the Keel Crossing footbridge to the ground), Sheepfolds Stables street food and bars on the route, the Fans Museum between Roker and the stadium (open to away fans, serves drinks), and pubs along Roker seafront; the Beacon of Light Fanzone next to the stadium is open to both sets of fans from two and a half hours before kick-off. Football Ground Guide names Greens, Streetbar SR1, The Albion, The Wheatsheaf and The Avenue as away-friendly.":"Klubbens guide henviser udebanefans til pubber omkring Keel Square og High Street West i centrum (og derfra over gangbroen Keel Crossing til stadion), Sheepfolds Stables med streetfood og barer på ruten, Fans Museum mellem Roker og stadion (åbent for udebanefans, serverer drikkevarer) og pubber langs strandpromenaden i Roker; Beacon of Light Fanzone ved siden af stadion er åben for begge holds fans fra to og en halv time før kampstart. Football Ground Guide nævner Greens, Streetbar SR1, The Albion, The Wheatsheaf og The Avenue som venlige over for udebanefans.","The first Double, and nearly a treble — the League Cup final was lost to Aston Villa in March. Roy Keane came from Forest for a British record £3.75m; Cantona was Footballer of the Year. United led the league from August, saw a 16-point gap shrink to three as Blackburn chased, then won six of the last seven. The FA Cup final was 4–0 against Chelsea, who had beaten United twice in the league, with Cantona scoring two penalties in the rain.":"Den første Double, og næsten en treble — Liga Cup-finalen blev tabt til Aston Villa i marts. Roy Keane kom fra Forest for britisk rekordbeløb på £3.75m; Cantona blev kåret som Årets Spiller. United førte ligaen fra august, så et forspring på 16 point skrumpe til tre, da Blackburn jagtede, og vandt så seks af de sidste syv. FA Cup-finalen endte 4–0 mod Chelsea, som havde slået United to gange i ligaen, med Cantona, der scorede på to straffespark i regnen.","The first FA Cup. United beat Brighton, Everton, Blackburn, Burnley and Newcastle on the way to the final at Crystal Palace, where Sandy Turnbull scored the only goal against Bristol City after a Harold Halse shot hit the bar. The same season the club also won the first Charity Shield (1908) and began building Old Trafford, which opened in February 1910.":"Den første FA Cup-titel. United slog Brighton, Everton, Blackburn, Burnley og Newcastle på vejen til finalen på Crystal Palace, hvor Sandy Turnbull scorede kampens eneste mål mod Bristol City, efter at et skud fra Harold Halse havde ramt overliggeren. Samme sæson vandt klubben også den første Charity Shield (1908) og begyndte at bygge Old Trafford, som åbnede i februar 1910.","The first title in 26 years and the first of the Premier League. United were tenth in November when Eric Cantona arrived from Leeds for £1.2m; they lost twice in the remaining 28 league games. The pivot was 10 April against Sheffield Wednesday: 1–0 down with four minutes left, Bruce headed two, the second in the seventh minute of stoppage time, and Ferguson and Brian Kidd ended up on the pitch. The title was confirmed on 2 May when Villa lost to Oldham; United beat Blackburn the next night and lifted the trophy.":"Det første mesterskab i 26 år og det første i Premier League. United lå nr. 10 i november, da Eric Cantona kom fra Leeds for £1.2m; de tabte to gange i de resterende 28 ligakampe. Vendepunktet var 10. april mod Sheffield Wednesday: bagud 0–1 med fire minutter igen headede Bruce to ind, det andet i syvende minut af overtiden, og Ferguson og Brian Kidd endte ude på banen. Mesterskabet blev sikret 2. maj, da Villa tabte til Oldham; United slog Blackburn aftenen efter og løftede trofæet.","The first title since Munich, taken from Leeds on goal average after both finished on 61 points — the closest finish the division had seen. Law scored 28 in the league and 39 in all competitions and was named European Footballer of the Year; Best, 18, played every league game. The decisive stretch was April: Leeds beaten 1–0 at Elland Road, then seven straight wins.":"Det første mesterskab siden München, taget fra Leeds på målkvotient, efter at begge sluttede på 61 point — den tætteste afslutning, divisionen havde set. Law scorede 28 i ligaen og 39 i alle turneringer og blev kåret som Europas bedste fodboldspiller; Best, 18, spillede alle ligakampe. Den afgørende periode var april: Leeds slået 1–0 på Elland Road, derefter syv sejre i træk.","The first title won at Old Trafford, settled on the last afternoon. United needed to beat Sunderland and hope Villa slipped at Liverpool; they won 5–1 and Villa lost 3–1. Mangnall left for Manchester City the following year, and it would be 41 years before the next championship.":"Det første mesterskab vundet på Old Trafford, afgjort den sidste eftermiddag. United skulle slå Sunderland og håbe, at Villa snublede i Liverpool; de vandt 5–1, og Villa tabte 1–3. Mangnall skiftede til Manchester City året efter, og der skulle gå 41 år til det næste mesterskab.","The first trophy in six years, in Ten Hag's first season. Ronaldo left in November after the Piers Morgan interview; Rashford scored 30; Casemiro arrived from Real Madrid and scored the first goal in the final against Newcastle, Sven Botman's own goal the second. The FA Cup final — the first Manchester derby final — was lost 2–1 to City, who went on to the treble.":"Det første trofæ i seks år, i Ten Hags første sæson. Ronaldo rejste i november efter interviewet med Piers Morgan; Rashford scorede 30; Casemiro kom fra Real Madrid og scorede det første mål i finalen mod Newcastle, Sven Botmans selvmål det andet. FA Cup-finalen — den første Manchester-derbyfinale — blev tabt 1–2 til City, som gik videre til The Treble.","The ground is just under 10 minutes' walk from Ipswich railway station (about a quarter of a mile: straight over the bridge from the station, right at the Royal Mail sorting office). The town centre is less than 10 minutes' walk away. Trains run from London Liverpool Street (Greater Anglia, 2-3 an hour, about 70 minutes on faster services) and hourly from Peterborough with short 4-coach trains that get very busy. A London Road Park and Ride bus stops a short walk from the stadium.":"Stadion ligger knap 10 minutters gang fra Ipswich-togstationen (cirka en kvart mile: lige over broen fra stationen, til højre ved Royal Mails sorteringscentral). Bymidten ligger under 10 minutters gang væk. Togene kører fra London Liverpool Street (Greater Anglia, 2-3 i timen, cirka 70 minutter med de hurtigste afgange) og hver time fra Peterborough med korte tog på 4 vogne, der bliver meget fyldte. En London Road Park and Ride-bus stopper kort gang fra stadion.","The largest winning margin in Premier League history at the time — 18 points — with eleven straight wins to finish. United did not defend the FA Cup, going to Brazil for the Club World Championship instead, but in November had beaten Palmeiras in Tokyo to be world champions: Keane scored, Mark Bosnich made the saves. The European Cup went at the quarter-final, 3–2 at home to Real Madrid after a 0–0 in the Bernabéu.":"Den største vindermargin i Premier Leagues historie på det tidspunkt — 18 point — med elleve sejre i træk til slut. United forsvarede ikke FA Cup-titlen, men tog i stedet til Brasilien til VM for klubhold; i november havde de dog slået Palmeiras i Tokyo og var blevet verdensmestre: Keane scorede, Mark Bosnich stod for redningerne. Mesterholdenes Europa Cup røg i kvartfinalen, 2–3 hjemme mod Real Madrid efter 0–0 på Bernabéu.","The nearest tube is Fulham Broadway (District line, Wimbledon branch; change at Earl's Court if needed), 5 to 10 minutes' walk; it is step-free with lifts. West Brompton and Imperial Wharf (Overground, between Clapham Junction and Willesden Junction) are about 15 minutes' walk. Buses 14, 211 and 414 stop outside on Fulham Road. Fulham Road between Harwood Road and Hortensia Road closes 90 minutes before kick-off until about an hour after; parking is residents-only, so the club advises public transport.":"Den nærmeste undergrundsstation er Fulham Broadway (District-linjen, Wimbledon-grenen; skift ved Earl's Court om nødvendigt), 5 til 10 minutters gang; den er trinfri med elevatorer. West Brompton og Imperial Wharf (Overground, mellem Clapham Junction og Willesden Junction) ligger cirka 15 minutters gang væk. Bus 14, 211 og 414 stopper udenfor på Fulham Road. Fulham Road mellem Harwood Road og Hortensia Road lukker 90 minutter før kampstart til cirka en time efter; parkering er kun for beboere, så klubben anbefaler offentlig transport.","The official 2026/27 away guide says small bags are OK and will be searched, larger bags and luggage are not allowed and there is no storage, so avoid bringing a bag; Villa's own matchday pages say no bags larger than A4, all bags are searched and bags can be registered at villa.dropmybag.co.uk. Flags and banners need a photo emailed to the club at least 3 days before.":"Den officielle udebaneguide for 2026/27 siger, at små tasker er OK og bliver visiteret, større tasker og bagage er ikke tilladt, og der er ingen opbevaring, så undgå at tage en taske med; Villas egne kampdagssider siger ingen tasker større end A4, alle tasker visiteres, og tasker kan registreres på villa.dropmybag.co.uk. Flag og bannere kræver, at et foto mailes til klubben mindst 3 dage før.","The one that kept Ferguson in the job, or so the story goes: United finished 13th and had been out of the top half most of the season. Mark Robins' header at Forest in the third round started a run of away draws all the way to Wembley. The final against Crystal Palace was 3–3, Hughes equalising in extra time; Ferguson dropped Jim Leighton for the replay and Les Sealey kept a clean sheet as Lee Martin's goal won it.":"Den, der reddede Fergusons job, siger historien: United sluttede som nr. 13 og havde ligget i den nederste halvdel det meste af sæsonen. Mark Robins' hovedstød mod Forest i tredje runde startede en stime af udekampe hele vejen til Wembley. Finalen mod Crystal Palace endte 3–3, med Hughes' udligning i den forlængede spilletid; Ferguson satte Jim Leighton af til omkampen, og Les Sealey holdt nullet, da Lee Martins mål afgjorde det.","The season the title slipped — top in April, then four games in eight days and Leeds went past — but two cups came in. Red Star Belgrade, European champions, were beaten 1–0 in the Super Cup at Old Trafford in November, and McClair's goal won the first League Cup against Nottingham Forest in April. Peter Schmeichel arrived in the summer; Ryan Giggs, 18, was PFA Young Player of the Year.":"Sæsonen, hvor mesterskabet gled væk — førende i april, så fire kampe på otte dage, og Leeds gik forbi — men to pokaler kom i hus. Røde Stjerne Beograd, europamestre, blev slået 1–0 i Super Cup'en på Old Trafford i november, og McClairs mål vandt den første Liga Cup mod Nottingham Forest i april. Peter Schmeichel kom om sommeren; Ryan Giggs, 18, blev kåret som PFA Young Player of the Year.","The stadium and campus are fully cashless. The stadium opens two hours before kick-off; arriving early avoids peak transport and security queues. Touchline Grills and Tap Inns in the visitors' section open two hours before kick-off; every attendee, including babes in arms, needs a ticket. For United's 23 May visit the trips page assumes a day trip via Stansted - the 06:00 Ryanair out and an evening flight home.":"Stadion og området omkring er helt kontantfrie. Stadion åbner to timer før kampstart; kommer du tidligt, undgår du myldretiden i transporten og køerne ved sikkerhedstjekket. Touchline Grills og Tap Inns i udebaneafsnittet åbner to timer før kampstart; alle tilskuere, også spædbørn, skal have billet. Til Uniteds besøg den 23. maj regner turesiden med en dagstur via Stansted - Ryanair kl. 06:00 ud og et aftenfly hjem.","The stadium is about 4 miles from Brighton city centre, so do not try to walk from Brighton station. Take a train from Brighton station to Falmer (about 7-10 minutes, roughly four trains an hour on matchdays); Falmer station is about 250m from the stadium and a short walk to the South Stand away end. Trains are very busy, so Brighton advise boarding around an hour before kick-off, or use Lewes (one stop beyond Falmer) as a quieter alternative. Bus 25 stops at Village Way (nearest stop) and bus 23 serves Falmer village and station; buses do not run from Brighton station itself. Your match ticket gives free train and bus travel in the Free Travel Zone from 3.5 hours before kick-off until 3.5 hours after the final whistle - fans from London only need a rail ticket as far as Haywards Heath.":"Stadion ligger cirka 4 miles fra Brightons centrum, så prøv ikke at gå fra Brighton-stationen. Tag et tog fra Brighton-stationen til Falmer (cirka 7-10 minutter, omtrent fire tog i timen på kampdage); Falmer-stationen ligger cirka 250m fra stadion og kort gang fra udebaneenden i South Stand. Togene er meget fyldte, så Brighton råder til at stige på cirka en time før kampstart eller bruge Lewes (et stop efter Falmer) som et roligere alternativ. Bus 25 stopper ved Village Way (nærmeste stop), og bus 23 kører til Falmer by og station; busserne kører ikke fra selve Brighton-stationen. Din kampbillet giver gratis tog og bus i Free Travel Zone fra 3.5 timer før kampstart til 3.5 timer efter slutfløjtet - fans fra London skal kun have togbillet til Haywards Heath.","The stadium is about 7km north of the centre. Visiting clubs (Tottenham 2022, Arsenal 2024) tell away fans to take the Green (Verde) metro line from Rossio/Baixa to Telheiras, about 15 minutes, then walk roughly 10 minutes to the away gate under police direction; both stations are step-free. Do not get off at Campo Grande, which is next to the stadium but reserved for home fans and described as strictly forbidden for away supporters. Fans are also advised to stay in the city centre and avoid the stadium area until travelling to the match.":"Stadion ligger cirka 7km nord for centrum. Gæsteklubber (Tottenham 2022, Arsenal 2024) beder udebanefans tage den grønne (Verde) metrolinje fra Rossio/Baixa til Telheiras, cirka 15 minutter, og derefter gå omkring 10 minutter til udebaneindgangen under politiets anvisning; begge stationer er trinfri. Stå ikke af ved Campo Grande, som ligger ved siden af stadion, men er forbeholdt hjemmefans og beskrives som strengt forbudt for udebanefans. Fans rådes også til at blive i centrum og undgå området ved stadion, indtil de tager til kampen.","The stadium is cashless. Only travel with a valid ticket; no upgrades on the day, and bring photo ID to collect a pre-arranged duplicate from the main ticket office. Food and drink are served in the away section; redevelopment works around the ground mean you should allow extra time and follow stewards.":"Stadion er kontantfrit. Rejs kun med en gyldig billet; ingen opgraderinger på dagen, og medbring billed-ID for at afhente et forudaftalt duplikat på det centrale billetkontor. Der serveres mad og drikke i udebaneafsnittet; ombygningsarbejde omkring stadion betyder, at du skal beregne ekstra tid og følge stewarderne.","The stadium is cashless; the away end sells food and drink from two hours before afternoon games (6.30pm before evening games) with an Early Bird pie-and-pint offer up to 45 minutes before kick-off. Tickets are emailed as PDFs to scan on your phone; the Match Day Box Office is next to the Armoury store on the west side and opens 3 hours before kick-off. Buggies and prams are not allowed and under-14s must be with an adult.":"Stadion er kontantfrit; udebaneafsnittet sælger mad og drikke fra to timer før eftermiddagskampe (kl. 18.30 før aftenkampe) med et Early Bird-tilbud på tærte og øl indtil 45 minutter før kampstart. Billetterne mailes som PDF'er, der scannes på telefonen; Match Day Box Office ligger ved siden af Armoury-butikken på vestsiden og åbner 3 timer før kampstart. Klapvogne og barnevogne er ikke tilladt, og børn under 14 skal være med en voksen.","The stadium is fully cashless (contactless, Apple Pay, Google Pay; chip and PIN over £45). Arrive early - turnstiles open 90 minutes before kick-off and searches are thorough. Early Bird prices in the away kiosks for the first 30 minutes after opening (£4 draught beer, £4 pies); alcohol may be withdrawn for high-risk fixtures. Report issues by texting BFC plus your message to 62277. For ticket problems on the day go to the stadium Box Office before entering.":"Stadion er helt kontantfrit (kontaktløs, Apple Pay, Google Pay; chip og PIN over £45). Kom tidligt - tælleapparaterne åbner 90 minutter før kampstart, og visitationen er grundig. Early Bird-priser i udebanekioskerne de første 30 minutter efter åbning (£4 fadøl, £4 tærter); alkohol kan blive trukket tilbage ved højrisikokampe. Anmeld problemer ved at sende BFC plus din besked til 62277. Ved billetproblemer på dagen skal du gå til stadions billetkontor, før du går ind.","The stadium is in the town itself, about 10 minutes' walk north of the centre. Vila-real station is on the Renfe Cercanías C-6 line between València Nord and Castelló: around 50 to 60 minutes from Valencia and 10 to 20 minutes from Castellón, with several trains an hour off-peak; the walk from the station to the ground is flat and takes 15 to 20 minutes. Most away fans stay in Valencia or Castellón because hotels in Vila-real are very limited. UK government advice for United's 2021 visit quoted taxis at about EUR 80 to Valencia and EUR 20 to Castellón.":"Stadion ligger i selve byen, cirka 10 minutters gang nord for centrum. Vila-real-stationen ligger på Renfe Cercanías-linjen C-6 mellem València Nord og Castelló: cirka 50 til 60 minutter fra Valencia og 10 til 20 minutter fra Castellón, med flere tog i timen uden for myldretid; gåturen fra stationen til stadion er flad og tager 15 til 20 minutter. De fleste udebanefans bor i Valencia eller Castellón, fordi der er meget få hoteller i Vila-real. Den britiske regerings råd ved Uniteds besøg i 2021 angav taxapriser på cirka EUR 80 til Valencia og EUR 20 til Castellón.","The title back after three years of Arsenal and Chelsea. Ronaldo, booed everywhere after the World Cup, won both player-of-the-year awards; Scholes was reborn in a deeper role; Vidić and Evra settled. Roma were beaten 7–1 at Old Trafford in April; Milan ended the European run in the semi-final. The championship came on 6 May when Chelsea drew with Arsenal the day after Ronaldo's penalty beat City at the Etihad.":"Mesterskabet tilbage efter tre år med Arsenal og Chelsea. Ronaldo, der blev buhet ud overalt efter VM, vandt begge kåringer som årets spiller; Scholes blev genfødt i en mere tilbagetrukket rolle; Vidić og Evra faldt til. Roma blev slået 7–1 på Old Trafford i april; Milan stoppede det europæiske eventyr i semifinalen. Mesterskabet kom 6. maj, da Chelsea spillede uafgjort mod Arsenal dagen efter, at Ronaldos straffespark havde slået City på Etihad.","The treble season, 1998–99, is the only time an English club has won the league, FA Cup and European Cup in one year. Last trophy: the 2024 FA Cup. 2025–26: 3rd in the Premier League on 71 points, back in the Champions League.":"The Treble-sæsonen, 1998–99, er den eneste gang, en engelsk klub har vundet ligaen, FA Cup og Mesterholdenes Europa Cup samme år. Seneste trofæ: FA Cup 2024. 2025–26: nr. 3 i Premier League med 71 point, tilbage i Champions League.","The trophy that stopped Liverpool's treble. Docherty's young wing-heavy side had lost the previous year's final to Southampton; this time they beat the league champions and European Cup finalists with two goals in five second-half minutes, Jimmy Greenhoff's winner deflecting in off his chest from Lou Macari's shot. Docherty was sacked six weeks later.":"Trofæet, der stoppede Liverpools treble. Dochertys unge hold med de mange kantspillere havde tabt året før finalen til Southampton; denne gang slog de ligamestrene og finalisterne i Mesterholdenes Europa Cup med to mål på fem minutter i anden halvleg, hvor Jimmy Greenhoffs sejrsmål blev afrettet ind via hans bryst på et skud fra Lou Macari. Docherty blev fyret seks uger senere.","The worst league season since 1990 and the 13th FA Cup, won against Manchester City at Wembley with two first-half goals from academy graduates: Garnacho after Ortega and Gvardiol collided, Mainoo from Fernandes's pass. Doku pulled one back late. It was the second consecutive derby final and the first United had won; Ten Hag kept his job on the strength of it, for five more months.":"Den dårligste ligasæson siden 1990 og den 13. FA Cup-titel, vundet mod Manchester City på Wembley med to mål i første halvleg fra akademiprodukter: Garnacho, efter at Ortega og Gvardiol stødte sammen, og Mainoo på aflevering fra Fernandes. Doku reducerede sent. Det var den anden derbyfinale i træk og den første, United vandt; Ten Hag beholdt jobbet på grund af den, i fem måneder mere.","Three in a row for the first time in the club's history, with Sheringham, 35, as Footballer of the Year and PFA Player of the Year. The gap was 16 points in March. Arsenal were beaten 6–1 at Old Trafford in February, Yorke scoring a hat-trick in the first 22 minutes; the title arrived on 14 April after Arsenal lost at Middlesbrough and United beat Coventry.":"Tre i træk for første gang i klubbens historie, med Sheringham, 35, som Årets Spiller og PFA Player of the Year. Forspringet var 16 point i marts. Arsenal blev slået 6–1 på Old Trafford i februar, hvor Yorke lavede hattrick i de første 22 minutter; mesterskabet kom i hus 14. april, efter at Arsenal tabte i Middlesbrough, og United slog Coventry.","Three in a row for the second time, equalling Liverpool's 18 titles. Van der Sar went 1,311 league minutes without conceding, a record; Berbatov came from Spurs for £30.75m; Rooney, Ronaldo and Tevez shared the goals. The Club World Cup was won in Yokohama in December, the League Cup on penalties against Tottenham in March, the title with a 0–0 against Arsenal in May. The Champions League final in Rome was lost 2–0 to Barcelona, and Ronaldo left for Madrid for £80m.":"Tre i træk for anden gang og lige med Liverpools 18 mesterskaber. Van der Sar gik 1,311 ligaminutter uden at lukke mål ind, en rekord; Berbatov kom fra Spurs for £30.75m; Rooney, Ronaldo og Tevez delte målene. VM for klubhold blev vundet i Yokohama i december, Liga Cup'en efter straffespark mod Tottenham i marts, mesterskabet med 0–0 mod Arsenal i maj. Champions League-finalen i Rom blev tabt 0–2 til Barcelona, og Ronaldo skiftede til Madrid for £80m.","Tickets are digital/print-at-home and sent to the lead booker about five days before the game; download them before you set off and do not travel without one. Aim to be at the gate at least an hour before kick-off. Kiosks were card-only at Arsenal's visit; watch for pickpockets and keep passport and cash separate.":"Billetterne er digitale/print-selv og sendes til hovedbookeren cirka fem dage før kampen; download dem, før du tager af sted, og rejs ikke uden. Sigt efter at være ved indgangen mindst en time før kampstart. Kioskerne tog kun kort ved Arsenals besøg; pas på lommetyve, og hold pas og kontanter adskilt.","Traffic around the ground is heavy after the game; allow 20 to 45 minutes to clear the area, or walk back to Boscombe/Pokesdown (about 15 minutes) or take a bus to Bournemouth Square. Last train times to London or Manchester: not stated; post-match journeys are much longer on engineering-work weekends, so check your route.":"Trafikken omkring stadion er tæt efter kampen; beregn 20 til 45 minutter for at komme væk fra området, eller gå tilbage til Boscombe/Pokesdown (cirka 15 minutter) eller tag en bus til Bournemouth Square. Sidste tog til London eller Manchester: ikke oplyst; rejser efter kampen tager meget længere tid i weekender med sporarbejde, så tjek din rute.","Trophies are those United won in a season he played for the club: an appearance in the squad list (1993/94 on), or a goal or a final before that. Seasons inside his Wikipedia career years with no appearance on record are listed apart. A loan spell away is not checked, and a player who left mid-season is still counted for that season. Final line-ups are recorded to 1992/93.":"Trofæerne er dem, United vandt i en sæson, hvor han spillede for klubben: en optræden på truplisten (fra 1993/94), eller et mål eller en finale før det. Sæsoner inden for hans karriereår på Wikipedia uden registrerede kampe står for sig. Et lejeophold andetsteds tjekkes ikke, og en spiller, der rejste midt i sæsonen, tælles stadig med for den sæson. Finaleopstillinger er registreret til 1992/93.","Two cups in Mourinho's first season, plus the Community Shield; the league was 25 games unbeaten and still only sixth, with 15 draws. Ibrahimović, 35, scored 28, two of them in the League Cup final against Southampton — the winner a header in the 87th minute. Pogba returned for a world-record £89m. The Europa League, the one European trophy United had never won, was taken in Stockholm against Ajax two days after the Manchester Arena bombing: Pogba and Mkhitaryan, and a Champions League place.":"To pokaler i Mourinhos første sæson, plus Community Shield; i ligaen 25 kampe uden nederlag og alligevel kun nr. 6 med 15 uafgjorte. Ibrahimović, 35, scorede 28, to af dem i Liga Cup-finalen mod Southampton — sejrsmålet et hovedstød i det 87. minut. Pogba vendte tilbage for verdensrekordbeløbet £89m. Europa League, det ene europæiske trofæ United aldrig havde vundet, blev taget i Stockholm mod Ajax to dage efter bombeangrebet på Manchester Arena: Pogba og Mkhitaryan, og en plads i Champions League.","United's away allocation is sold on tickets.manutd.com to members in order of away credits (your members' login). The host club's ticket office is the other official route — their home areas, members' schemes and hospitality. Football tickets may only be resold in the UK by the clubs or their authorised partners, so unofficial resale sites are left out.":"Uniteds udebanetildeling sælges på tickets.manutd.com til medlemmer i rækkefølge efter away credits (dit medlemslogin). Værtsklubbens billetkontor er den anden officielle vej — deres hjemmeafsnit, medlemsordninger og hospitality. Fodboldbilletter må kun videresælges i UK af klubberne eller deres autoriserede partnere, så uofficielle videresalgssider er udeladt.","Valencia Airport (VLC), about 70km south, is the practical gateway: metro into Valencia then Cercanías C-6 to Vila-real, roughly an hour from the city. The trips page notes no direct CPH flight that week (one stop via Amsterdam).":"Valencia Airport (VLC), cirka 70km mod syd, er den praktiske indgang: metro ind til Valencia og derefter Cercanías C-6 til Vila-real, cirka en time fra byen. Turesiden bemærker, at der ikke var noget direkte fly fra CPH den uge (et stop via Amsterdam).","Villa Park is cashless (cash back available at the ticket office with a £3.50 minimum spend; nearest cash machine at Tesco Extra, Aston Lane). Have your ticket ready - barriers with ticket checks are sometimes used at the turnstiles. Alcohol is sold only in Doug Ellis Lower Block Q (none in Upper Block P, no transfers) and not at all for some fixtures - call 0333 323 1874 to check. Upper tier fans should buy programmes from the Witton Lane kiosks before entering. Uncollected tickets go to the visitors' ticket office on Witton Lane opposite the away coach park, open about 90 minutes before kick-off. Follow @WMPVillaFC for travel updates.":"Villa Park er kontantfri (cash back kan fås ved billetkontoret med et minimumskøb på £3.50; nærmeste hæveautomat ved Tesco Extra, Aston Lane). Hav din billet klar - der bruges nogle gange afspærringer med billettjek ved tælleapparaterne. Alkohol sælges kun i Doug Ellis Lower Block Q (ikke i Upper Block P, ingen skift) og slet ikke ved nogle kampe - ring på 0333 323 1874 for at tjekke. Fans på øverste etage bør købe kampprogram fra kioskerne på Witton Lane, før de går ind. Ikke-afhentede billetter går til udebanefansenes billetkontor på Witton Lane over for udebanebussernes parkeringsplads, åbent cirka 90 minutter før kampstart. Følg @WMPVillaFC for rejseopdateringer.","Villa say there is no dedicated away pub or bar near the ground and advise drinking in Birmingham city centre. Football Ground Guide lists The Witton Arms (Witton Road), The Bartons Arms (High Street, Aston) and The Yew Tree (Brookvale Road) but warns some pubs check tickets.":"Villa siger, at der ikke er nogen dedikeret udebanepub eller -bar nær stadion, og råder til at drikke i Birminghams centrum. Football Ground Guide nævner The Witton Arms (Witton Road), The Bartons Arms (High Street, Aston) og The Yew Tree (Brookvale Road), men advarer om, at nogle pubber tjekker billetter.","Visiting fans are in the Anfield Road Stand (allocation around 3000 for league games) with licensed safe standing in rows 6-35. Enter via gates Q and R, approaching Anfield Road from the 97 Avenue direction; there is no access from Arkles Lane. Turnstiles open 2 hours before kick-off.":"Udebanefans er i Anfield Road Stand (tildeling omkring 3000 til ligakampe) med godkendte ståpladser i række 6-35. Gå ind ved indgang Q og R, og kom til Anfield Road fra 97 Avenue-siden; der er ingen adgang fra Arkles Lane. Tælleapparaterne åbner 2 timer før kampstart.","Visiting fans are usually held in the stadium for 20 to 30 minutes after the final whistle. For a 21:00 kick-off Manchester City's 2025/26 guide warned that public transport from Villarreal stops at 22:00 local time, so there are no trains or buses after the game and only a few taxis; pre-book coaches or taxis back to Valencia or Castellón. For daytime games the Cercanías platform fills quickly after the whistle, so buy a return ticket on arrival.":"Udebanefans holdes normalt på stadion i 20 til 30 minutter efter slutfløjtet. Ved en kampstart kl. 21:00 advarede Manchester Citys guide for 2025/26 om, at den offentlige transport fra Villarreal stopper kl. 22:00 lokal tid, så der er ingen tog eller busser efter kampen og kun få taxaer; forudbestil bus eller taxa tilbage til Valencia eller Castellón. Ved kampe i dagtimerne bliver Cercanías-perronen hurtigt fyldt efter slutfløjtet, så køb en returbillet ved ankomsten.","Visiting supporters are in Blocks 114 to 118 in the north-east corner, lower tier (Block 234 for accessible seating). Approach via Worcester Avenue and use Entrances 11 and 12 (11a is the accessible entrance); there is a security cordon, metal detector and pat-down before the ticket turnstiles.":"Udebanefans er i blok 114 til 118 i det nordøstlige hjørne, nederste etage (blok 234 til handicappladser). Kom via Worcester Avenue og brug indgang 11 og 12 (11a er handicapindgangen); der er sikkerhedsafspærring, metaldetektor og kropsvisitation før billettælleapparaterne.","Visiting supporters are in the corner of the Arthur Wait Stand next to the Whitehorse Lane end (around 2000 places); the away turnstiles are on one side of the Arthur Wait Stand and away fans usually use entrances 4, 5, 6 or 7. Turnstiles open around two hours before kick-off.":"Udebanefans er i hjørnet af Arthur Wait Stand ved Whitehorse Lane-enden (cirka 2000 pladser); udebanens tælleapparater ligger på den ene side af Arthur Wait Stand, og udebanefans bruger normalt indgang 4, 5, 6 eller 7. Tælleapparaterne åbner cirka to timer før kampstart.","Witton station can have large queues after the match, with extra football services running to Birmingham New Street; the city centre shuttle bus also runs back to Dudley Street. Driving away can be slow (one reviewer reported about 90 minutes to rejoin the motorway). Last-train times: not stated.":"Der kan være lange køer ved Witton-stationen efter kampen, med ekstra fodboldtog til Birmingham New Street; shuttlebussen til centrum kører også tilbage til Dudley Street. Det kan gå langsomt at køre derfra (en anmelder skrev cirka 90 minutter for at komme ud på motorvejen igen). Sidste tog: ikke oplyst.","Won with ten men. Kevin Moran became the first player sent off in an FA Cup final, for a foul on Peter Reid with twelve minutes left; Everton, league champions and Cup Winners' Cup winners that week, were going for a treble. Whiteside's curling winner from the right in the 110th minute decided it. Hughes, 21, and Robson were the season's players; Hughes was PFA Young Player of the Year.":"Vundet med ti mand. Kevin Moran blev den første spiller, der blev udvist i en FA Cup-finale, for en tackling på Peter Reid med tolv minutter igen; Everton, ligamestre og vindere af Pokalvindernes Europa Cup samme uge, gik efter en treble. Whitesides skruede sejrsmål fra højre i det 110. minut afgjorde det. Hughes, 21, og Robson var sæsonens spillere; Hughes blev kåret som PFA Young Player of the Year.","Your question picks out the players, seasons, clubs or managers it mentions; their pages' data goes to the model with the question; nothing else does. Answers are cached, so a repeated question is instant. There's a limit of 20 questions an hour per visitor. Check the linked pages before quoting a figure — it's a summary of what's here, not a source in itself.":"Dit spørgsmål finder de spillere, sæsoner, klubber eller managere, det nævner; deres siders data sendes til modellen sammen med spørgsmålet; intet andet gør. Svar caches, så et gentaget spørgsmål besvares med det samme. Der er en grænse på 20 spørgsmål i timen pr. besøgende. Tjek de linkede sider, før du citerer et tal — det er et resumé af det, der står her, ikke en kilde i sig selv."});
